msgid ""
"The first time the engine starts after you log in, and again after a crash. A"
" session you stop stays stopped until you log in again."
msgstr "在您登入後引擎第一次啟動時執行，引擎當掉後也會再次執行。您停止的工作階段會保持停止，直到您再次登入。"

