#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyFace.qml:64 blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyPanel.qml:51
#: blocks/volume/ui/VolumeFace.qml:88 blocks/volume/ui/VolumePanel.qml:107
msgctxt "@info a gain as a percentage of the signal that arrived"
msgid "%1 %"
msgstr "%1 %"

#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyFace.qml:85
msgctxt "@label what the number on an Amplify tile is"
msgid "gain"
msgstr "增益"

#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyFace.qml:105 blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyHelp.qml:34
#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyPanel.qml:41 blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyPanel.qml:66
msgctxt "@label:slider how much an Amplify block multiplies the sound by"
msgid "Gain"
msgstr "增益"

#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyHelp.qml:16
msgctxt "@info help page of the Amplify block"
msgid ""
"Makes the sound louder, up to ten times, or quieter. It does that and nothing"
" else."
msgstr "讓聲音變大（最多十倍）或變小。它只做這件事，別無其他。"

#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyHelp.qml:21
msgctxt "@info help page of the Amplify block"
msgid ""
"Everything that reaches this block leaves it multiplied by the gain you set. "
"At 100 % the sound goes on exactly as it arrived; 200 % doubles its strength,"
" 1000 % makes it ten times as strong, and 0 % is silence."
msgstr ""
"傳到此區塊的所有聲音，都會乘上您設定的增益後再離開。100 % 時聲音原封不動地傳下去；200 % 讓強度加倍，1000 % 讓強度變成十倍，0 % "
"則是靜音。"

#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Amplify block"
msgid ""
"A change glides in over a fiftieth of a second, so moving the slider never "
"makes a click. The block adds no delay."
msgstr "變更會在五十分之一秒內平順過渡，因此移動滑桿絕不會產生喀噠聲。此區塊不增加任何延遲。"

#. i18n: "full scale" is the highest level digital sound can have.
#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Amplify block"
msgid ""
"Unlike Volume, it has no limiter. Sound made louder than full scale, the "
"loudest a digital signal can be, goes on that loud, and wherever it is played"
" or recorded its tops are cut off and it crackles. Use it for sound that is "
"too quiet, and watch a meter after it."
msgstr ""
"與「音量」不同，它沒有限制器。被調得比滿刻度（數位訊號所能達到的最大音量）還大的聲音會照樣傳下去，無論在哪裡播放或錄製，波峰都會被削掉並產生劈啪聲。請將它用於太小聲的聲音，並留意它之後的儀表。"

#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyHelp.qml:36
msgctxt "@info help page of the Amplify block"
msgid ""
"How strong the sound leaves the block, as a percentage of how it arrived, "
"from 0 to 1000 %. Drag the slider here or on the block's tile. A new block "
"starts at 100 %."
msgstr "聲音離開區塊時的強度，以傳入時的百分比表示，從 0 到 1000 %。可在這裡或區塊的圖塊上拖曳滑桿。新區塊從 100 % 開始。"

#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyHelp.qml:43
msgctxt "@info help page of the Amplify block"
msgid ""
"A microphone, a record player or an old recording is far too quiet, even at "
"Volume's 400 %."
msgstr "麥克風、唱盤或舊錄音實在太小聲，即使把「音量」開到 400 % 也一樣。"

#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyHelp.qml:44
msgctxt "@info help page of the Amplify block"
msgid ""
"You want a plain gain with no limiter shaping the loudest moments. For "
"turning a source up safely, use Volume."
msgstr "您想要單純的增益，不希望有限制器去修飾最大聲的瞬間。若要安全地調大來源，請使用「音量」。"

#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyHelp.qml:51
msgctxt "@info help page of the Amplify block"
msgid ""
"Put a Peak/RMS meter after the block. If it reaches the top, turn the gain "
"down until it no longer does."
msgstr "在此區塊之後放一個「峰值/RMS」儀表。如果它到達頂端，請調低增益，直到不再到頂為止。"

#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyHelp.qml:52
msgctxt "@info help page of the Amplify block"
msgid "To amplify and still be safe from clipping, put a Limiter after it."
msgstr "若要放大聲音又不怕削波，請在它之後放一個「限制器」。"

#: blocks/amplify/ui/AmplifyPanel.qml:83
msgctxt "@info what an Amplify block does"
msgid ""
"Multiplies the sound by the gain and does nothing else: nothing stops a loud "
"sound from clipping."
msgstr "將聲音乘上增益，別無其他：沒有任何機制能阻止大聲的聲音削波。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceFace.qml:80
msgctxt "@info the Application block has not been pointed at a program yet"
msgid "Choose an app"
msgstr "選擇應用程式"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceFace.qml:83
msgctxt "@info how many of the application's sounds are being captured"
msgid "%1 stream"
msgid_plural "%1 streams"
msgstr[0] "%1 個串流"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceFace.qml:84
msgctxt "@info the application the block is pointed at is not playing"
msgid "Waiting…"
msgstr "正在等待…"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceFace.qml:91
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip an application and what is happening to it, 'Firefox — 2 "
"streams'"
msgid "%1 — %2"
msgstr "%1 — %2"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:19
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"Brings in the sound of one program, such as a browser, a music player or a "
"call, while it plays."
msgstr "在某個程式播放時帶入它的聲音，例如瀏覽器、音樂播放器或通話。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"Choose a program, and the block takes a copy of what it plays and starts a "
"lane with it. The program goes on playing to its own speakers or headphones "
"as before, and does not notice."
msgstr "選擇一個程式後，此區塊會複製它播放的聲音，並以此開始一條軌道。該程式會照常播放到它自己的喇叭或耳機，完全不會察覺。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"The program does not have to be running. The block waits for it, and takes "
"its sound as soon as it plays. If it is closed and started again, the block "
"finds it again."
msgstr "程式不必正在執行。區塊會等待它，一開始播放就擷取其聲音。如果程式關閉後再次啟動，區塊也會再次找到它。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"A program that plays several sounds at once, such as a browser with two tabs,"
" is taken whole: the sounds arrive mixed together. Sound in more than two "
"channels, such as a film in surround, is folded into the left and the right "
"side."
msgstr ""
"同時播放多個聲音的程式（例如開了兩個分頁的瀏覽器）會被整個擷取：這些聲音會混合在一起傳入。超過兩個聲道的聲音（例如環繞聲的電影）會被縮混到左右兩側。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"Alert sounds, the short sounds a program makes for a notification, are always"
" left out."
msgstr "提示音，也就是程式發出通知時的短促聲音，一律會被排除。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:28
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"The tile on the canvas shows the program's name, and how many of its sounds "
"are being taken, or Waiting… while it plays nothing."
msgstr "畫布上的圖塊會顯示程式名稱，以及正在擷取它的幾個聲音；程式沒有播放任何聲音時則顯示「正在等待…」。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:38
#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:159
msgctxt "@label which application the block listens to"
msgid "Source"
msgstr "來源"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:39
#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:181
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Choose which application to capture"
msgstr "選擇要擷取的應用程式"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:41
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"The program the block listens to. A new block says Choose an app. Click it to"
" open a list of the programs playing now, and of those seen recently."
msgstr "區塊所聆聽的程式。新區塊會顯示「選擇應用程式」。按一下即可開啟清單，列出目前正在播放以及最近出現過的程式。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:42
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"Type in the box at the top to search the list. To choose a program that is "
"not running, type its name and choose it from the end of the list."
msgstr "在頂端的方塊中輸入文字即可搜尋清單。若要選擇尚未執行的程式，請輸入它的名稱，再從清單最後選取。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:43
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"While the program is not playing, a line under it says so. That is not a "
"fault: its sound is taken the moment it starts."
msgstr "程式沒有在播放時，下方會有一行文字說明。這並不是錯誤：程式一開始播放，就會擷取它的聲音。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:49
#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:222
msgctxt "@option:check open a web address when the session starts"
msgid "Open URL"
msgstr "開啟網址"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:50
#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:256
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Web address to open"
msgstr "要開啟的網址"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:52
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"Opens a web address each time the session starts, such as the page of a radio"
" station or the link to a meeting. Tick the box, then type the address in the"
" URL box under it."
msgstr "每次工作階段開始時開啟一個網址，例如廣播電台的網頁或會議連結。請勾選方塊，然後在下方的「網址」方塊中輸入位址。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:53
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"The address is opened by your browser or by whatever program your desktop "
"uses for it, not by Reverblabr. If two blocks have the same address, it is "
"opened once."
msgstr "網址是由您的瀏覽器或桌面為它指定的程式開啟，而不是由 Reverblabr 開啟。如果兩個區塊的網址相同，只會開啟一次。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:59
#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:278
msgctxt "@title:group which of the application's sounds to take"
msgid "Audio device selection"
msgstr "音訊裝置選擇"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:64
#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:331
msgctxt "@label the output devices whose sound the block takes"
msgid "Devices to capture from"
msgstr "要擷取的裝置"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:67
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"Which of the program's sounds to take, by where the program sends them. The "
"default output device is the speakers or headphones your desktop plays to "
"unless told otherwise."
msgstr "依程式把聲音送往何處，決定要擷取它的哪些聲音。預設輸出裝置是桌面在未另行指定時用來播放的喇叭或耳機。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:70
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Application block, a choice of Audio device selection"
msgid ""
"Default output device: only what the program plays to the default device. "
"This is what a new block takes, and what most people mean by the sound of a "
"program."
msgstr "「預設輸出裝置」：只擷取程式播放到預設裝置的聲音。這是新區塊的設定，也是大多數人所說的「程式的聲音」。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:71
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Application block, a choice of Audio device selection"
msgid "All output devices: everything the program plays, wherever it sends it."
msgstr "「所有輸出裝置」：程式播放的一切聲音，不論送往何處。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:72
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Application block, a choice of Audio device selection"
msgid ""
"Specified devices: only what the program plays to the devices you tick in the"
" list that appears under it. Use it for a program that plays a call to your "
"headset and its alerts to the speakers."
msgstr "「指定裝置」：只擷取程式播放到您在下方清單中所勾選裝置的聲音。適用於把通話送到耳麥、把提示音送到喇叭的程式。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:75
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"With the last choice and no device ticked, the block takes nothing, and a "
"line says so."
msgstr "選擇最後一項卻沒有勾選任何裝置時，區塊不會擷取任何聲音，並有一行文字說明。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:80
#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:381
#: blocks/inputdevice/ui/InputDeviceHelp.qml:54
#: blocks/inputdevice/ui/InputDevicePanel.qml:109
#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:75
#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:233
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumHelp.qml:39
#: blocks/spectrummeter/ui/SpectrumPanel.qml:122
#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioHelp.qml:45
#: blocks/systemaudio/ui/SystemAudioPanel.qml:127
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformHelp.qml:38
#: blocks/waveformmeter/ui/WaveformPanel.qml:134
msgctxt "@title:group the less usual settings"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "進階"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:82
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid "Click the heading to open these. Most people never need them."
msgstr "按一下標題即可展開這些設定。大多數人都不需要用到。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:88
#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:387
msgctxt ""
"@option:check take the microphone the application is recording from too"
msgid "Include audio input"
msgstr "包含音訊輸入"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:90
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"Also takes the microphone the program is listening to. In a call, that is "
"your side of the conversation, so the lane carries both sides."
msgstr "同時擷取程式正在聆聽的麥克風。通話時，那就是您這一方的聲音，因此軌道會包含雙方的聲音。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:91
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"The block follows the program: if you switch to another microphone in the "
"program, the block takes that one. It is off for a new block."
msgstr "區塊會跟隨程式：如果您在程式中切換到另一支麥克風，區塊就會擷取那一支。新區塊預設為關閉。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:97
#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:404
msgctxt "@option:check put the two sides of a call on one channel each"
msgid "Split between channels"
msgstr "分到兩個聲道"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:99
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"With Include audio input ticked: puts the microphone on the left channel and "
"the program on the right, each as one channel. In a recording of a call, each"
" side can then be edited apart."
msgstr "勾選「包含音訊輸入」時：將麥克風放在左聲道、程式放在右聲道，各佔一個聲道。在通話錄音中，雙方就可以分開編輯。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:100
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"It can only be ticked while the input is included, and it is off for a new "
"block."
msgstr "只有在包含輸入時才能勾選，新區塊預設為關閉。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:106
#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:420
msgctxt "@option:check put silence where the application plays nothing"
msgid "Fill playback gaps with silence"
msgstr "以靜音填補播放間隙"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:108
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"Decides what a Recorder after this block does while the program plays "
"nothing. Ticked, as it is for a new block, the pause is recorded as silence, "
"so the recording keeps time with the clock."
msgstr "決定此區塊之後的「錄音器」在程式沒有播放任何聲音時怎麼做。勾選時（新區塊的預設），停頓會錄成靜音，因此錄音的時間與實際時鐘一致。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:109
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"Unticked, the Recorder leaves the pauses out and the recording is only what "
"the program played. That only happens when everything reaching the Recorder "
"comes from programs set this way: a microphone or another source beside it "
"keeps the recording going."
msgstr ""
"不勾選時，「錄音器」會略去停頓，錄音只包含程式播放的內容。只有當傳到「錄音器」的所有聲音都來自這樣設定的程式時才會如此：如果旁邊還有麥克風或其他來源，錄音就會持續進行。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:110
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid "What you hear is the same either way."
msgstr "無論哪種方式，您聽到的都一樣。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:116
#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:439
msgctxt ""
"@option:check fold a surround stream's low-frequency channel into the mix"
msgid "Include the bass channel"
msgstr "包含低音聲道"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:118
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"Sound in surround, such as a film's, has a channel of its own for deep bass "
"effects. It is left out when the sound is folded into two sides, because "
"mixed in it makes everything sound heavy. Tick this to mix it in all the "
"same."
msgstr ""
"環繞聲（例如電影的聲音）有一個專門用於重低音效果的聲道。將聲音縮混成兩側時會略去這個聲道，因為混入後會讓一切聽起來太厚重。勾選此項即可照樣將它混入。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:119
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid "It changes nothing for a program that plays in stereo."
msgstr "對於以立體聲播放的程式，這不會有任何影響。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:126
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"You want to record a call, a lesson or a podcast from the program that plays "
"it."
msgstr "您想從播放通話、課程或 Podcast 的程式錄下它們。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:127
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid "You want to change how one program sounds, without touching the others."
msgstr "您想改變某個程式的聲音，而不影響其他程式。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:128
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"You want to stream the music of one player and nothing else that happens on "
"the computer."
msgstr "您想串流某個播放器的音樂，而不包含電腦上的其他任何聲音。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:135
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"The program still plays to its own device. If the lane ends in an Output "
"Device on the same speakers, you hear it twice. Send the program somewhere "
"else in the system's sound settings, or use the lane only to record."
msgstr ""
"程式仍會播放到它自己的裝置。如果軌道的終點是同一組喇叭上的「輸出裝置」，您會聽到兩次。請在系統的音效設定中把該程式送到別處，或只用這條軌道來錄音。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:136
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"Start the program playing before you choose it: it is then at the top of the "
"list, with how many sounds it is playing."
msgstr "請先讓程式開始播放再選擇它：這樣它就會出現在清單頂端，並顯示它正在播放幾個聲音。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourceHelp.qml:137
msgctxt "@info help page of the Application block"
msgid ""
"To take everything the computer plays, use a System Audio block instead."
msgstr "若要擷取電腦播放的所有聲音，請改用「系統音訊」區塊。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:94
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"What most people mean by the sound of an application. Anything it sends "
"somewhere else, it sends there on purpose."
msgstr "大多數人所說的「應用程式的聲音」。它送到其他地方的聲音，都是刻意送過去的。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:101
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid "Every sound the application makes, whichever device it sends it to."
msgstr "應用程式發出的每一個聲音，不論送往哪個裝置。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:108
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"For an application that plays the thing you want to one device and something "
"else to another — a call on the headset and an alert on the speakers."
msgstr "適用於把您要的聲音播放到一個裝置、其他聲音播放到另一個裝置的應用程式，例如通話送到耳麥、提示音送到喇叭。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:214
msgctxt "@info the chosen application is not playing at the moment"
msgid "Not playing at the moment. It will be captured as soon as it is."
msgstr "目前沒有在播放。一開始播放就會擷取。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:238
msgctxt "@label:textbox a web address"
msgid "URL"
msgstr "網址"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:255
msgctxt "@info:placeholder what the web address is for"
msgid "Opened when the session starts"
msgstr "工作階段開始時開啟"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:367
msgctxt "@info no output has been named for the mode that needs one"
msgid "No output chosen, so nothing is being captured."
msgstr "未選擇輸出，因此沒有擷取任何聲音。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:389
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis what including the input does"
msgid ""
"Audio from input devices such as microphones is captured too — record both "
"sides of a VoIP call."
msgstr "也會擷取麥克風等輸入裝置的音訊，可錄下 VoIP 通話的雙方。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:406
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis what splitting a call does"
msgid "Inputs on the left channel, application audio on the right."
msgstr "輸入在左聲道，應用程式音訊在右聲道。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:422
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis what filling the gaps does"
msgid ""
"While the application plays nothing, a Recorder after this block records "
"silence, so the recording keeps time. Unticked, it leaves the pauses out. "
"What you hear is the same either way."
msgstr "應用程式沒有播放任何聲音時，此區塊之後的「錄音器」會錄下靜音，讓錄音的時間保持一致。不勾選時則會略去停頓。無論哪種方式，您聽到的都一樣。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:441
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis what including the bass channel does"
msgid ""
"A surround stream's low-frequency channel is mixed in rather than left out."
msgstr "環繞聲串流的低頻聲道會被混入，而不是略去。"

#: blocks/applicationsource/ui/ApplicationSourcePanel.qml:459
msgctxt "@action:button no application has been chosen yet"
msgid "Choose an app"
msgstr "選擇應用程式"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelFace.qml:68
msgctxt "@info Auto Level is switched on"
msgid "On"
msgstr "開啟"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelFace.qml:69
msgctxt "@info Auto Level is switched off"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "關閉"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelFace.qml:73
msgctxt "@label what an Auto Level tile says when the program declares music"
msgid "program says music"
msgstr "程式表明為音樂"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelFace.qml:82
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip what Auto Level is set to, 'Towards -23 LUFS, up by at most 18 "
"dB and down by at most 18 dB'"
msgid "Towards %1, up by at most %2 and down by at most %3"
msgstr "趨向 %1，最多提高 %2、最多降低 %3"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelFace.qml:86
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip what Auto Level is set to, 'Lifts towards -20 LUFS, by up to 18"
" dB'"
msgid "Lifts towards %1, by up to %2"
msgstr "向 %1 提升，最多 %2"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelFace.qml:90
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip what Auto Level is set to, 'Turns down towards -20 LUFS, by up "
"to 18 dB'"
msgid "Turns down towards %1, by up to %2"
msgstr "向 %1 調低，最多 %2"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelFace.qml:92
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Switched off: passes the sound through"
msgstr "已關閉：讓聲音直接通過"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelFace.qml:113
msgctxt "@info what an Auto Level tile says, '+6 dB, lifting'"
msgid "%1, %2"
msgstr "%1，%2"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelGraph.qml:58
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis Auto Level's graph"
msgid ""
"Level going out against level coming in. The numbers are in the line below "
"and in the table."
msgstr "輸出準位對應輸入準位的圖表。數值顯示在下方那一行和表格中。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelGraph.qml:124
msgctxt "@label an axis of Auto Level's graph"
msgid "Level coming in, LUFS, last 3 s"
msgstr "輸入準位，LUFS，最近 3 秒"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelGraph.qml:131
msgctxt "@label an axis of Auto Level's graph"
msgid "Level going out, LUFS"
msgstr "輸出準位，LUFS"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelGraph.qml:172
msgctxt "@label the part of Auto Level's graph under its gate"
msgid "too quiet to read"
msgstr "太小聲，無法讀取"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelGraph.qml:187
msgctxt ""
"@label on Auto Level's graph, 'target -23' and under it 'left alone ±1 LU'"
msgid ""
"target %1\n"
"left alone %2"
msgstr ""
"目標 %1\n"
"不調整 %2"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelGraph.qml:199
msgctxt "@label the dashed line on Auto Level's graph"
msgid "dashed: unchanged"
msgstr "虛線：不變"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelGraph.qml:211
msgctxt "@label the part of Auto Level's curve above the dashed line"
msgid "lifted"
msgstr "已提升"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelGraph.qml:223
msgctxt "@label the part of Auto Level's curve under the dashed line"
msgid "turned down"
msgstr "已調低"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:18
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"Lifts quiet passages towards a steady loudness and, if you ask, brings loud "
"ones down to it. Use it for a source whose level keeps changing, such as a "
"voice that comes and goes. The Voice Evener row in the library adds this "
"block set up for voices on a call."
msgstr ""
"將小聲的段落提升到穩定的響度，並可依您的要求，將大聲的段落降到同一響度。適用於準位不斷變化的來源，例如時有時無的人聲。區塊庫中的「人聲均勻器」項目會加入此區塊，並已設定為適合通話人聲。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"The block listens to how loud the sound has been over the last three seconds,"
" leaving out the pauses and breaths, and checks again ten times a second. "
"When the sound is quieter than the target, it turns it up by the difference."
msgstr "此區塊會聆聽最近三秒內聲音的響度（不計停頓和呼吸聲），並每秒重新檢查十次。當聲音比目標小聲時，就按差值調大。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"The block can also bring loud passages down. It is off until you turn it on, "
"and the Voice Evener preset turns it on. Then a loud talker comes down "
"towards the target as well as a quiet one coming up. It listens over the last"
" three seconds, so a new talker takes a few seconds to settle. If a loud "
"voice starts straight after a quiet one, the lift is pulled back within about"
" a tenth of a second, so that it doesn't stay at the quiet talker's level. "
"Keep this off for music and films: it would take the loud and soft out of "
"them."
msgstr ""
"此區塊也能把大聲的段落調低。這項功能在您開啟之前都是關閉的，而「人聲均勻器」預設集會將它開啟。開啟後，大聲的說話者會向目標調低，小聲的說話者也會向上調高。由於它聆聽的是最近三秒，新的說話者需要幾秒鐘才會穩定。如果大聲的人聲緊接在小聲的人聲之後出現，提升量會在約十分之一秒內拉回，以免停留在小聲說話者的準位。處理音樂和電影時請保持關閉：它會抹平其中的強弱起伏。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"Sound within the Leave alone range of the target is not moved. The graph "
"shows it as a shaded strip, and the dot is the sound now."
msgstr "落在目標「不調整範圍」內的聲音不會被移動。圖表以陰影帶表示這個範圍，圓點則代表目前的聲音。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"A very short sound, such as a door or a dropped headset, is over before this "
"block can act. While a boost stands it applies to everything on the lane, so "
"such a sound comes through louder, and only the limiter at the end holds it."
msgstr ""
"非常短的聲音（例如關門聲或耳機掉落聲）在此區塊來得及反應前就已結束。提升作用期間，會套用到軌道上的所有聲音，因此這類聲音會更大聲地通過，只有末端的限制器能壓住它。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"The lift rises slowly, over a few seconds, so a quiet word is brought up "
"gently rather than jumping. It falls quickly, within a few tenths of a "
"second, when the sound gets loud again, so a shout after a whisper is not "
"lifted for long."
msgstr ""
"提升量會緩慢上升，在幾秒內完成，讓小聲的字詞被平順地拉高，而不是突然跳起。當聲音再次變大時，提升量會在零點幾秒內迅速下降，因此耳語之後的喊叫不會被提升太久。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:28
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"Very quiet sound, below about −50 LUFS, is taken to be background noise and "
"is not lifted. The lift then drifts back slowly, so a short pause between "
"sentences does not undo it."
msgstr "非常小聲的聲音（低於約 −50 LUFS）會被視為背景雜訊，不會被提升。此時提升量會慢慢回落，因此句子之間的短暫停頓不會讓它歸零。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:29
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"The tile on the canvas shows what the block is doing to the sound right now, "
"in decibels (dB), and says so in a word: lifting, turning down, at the "
"maximum, pulled back, left alone or too quiet to read. While nothing plays, "
"it shows On or Off and says Not playing. If the program in front of the block"
" declares that it is playing music or a film, the tile says so, and the card "
"says what to do about it. A program that declares nothing tells the block "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"畫布上的圖塊會以分貝（dB）顯示區塊目前對聲音的作用，並用一個詞說明：「提升中」、「調低中」、「已達最大值」、「已拉回」、「未調整」或「太小聲，無法讀取」。沒有播放時，會顯示「開啟」或「關閉」，並標示「未播放」。如果區塊前方的程式表明正在播放音樂或電影，圖塊會顯示出來，卡片則會說明該怎麼處理。沒有表明任何內容的程式，不會告訴區塊任何資訊。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:30
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"The card shows the lowest and highest change of the last minute as a line of "
"numbers. Nothing else is kept, and it is not saved."
msgstr "卡片會以一行數字顯示過去一分鐘內最低和最高的變化量。除此之外不會保留任何資料，也不會儲存。"

#. i18n: "full scale" is the highest level digital sound can have.
#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:32
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"At the end of the block a limiter is always at work, as in the Volume block. "
"It keeps the sound from going higher than 1 dB below full scale, the loudest "
"a digital signal can be, so the lift can never make it crackle. It holds the "
"sound back by one and a half thousandths of a second, far too little to hear."
msgstr ""
"區塊末端一律有一個限制器在運作，就像「音量」區塊一樣。它會讓聲音保持在比滿刻度（數位訊號所能達到的最大音量）低 1 dB "
"以下，因此提升永遠不會讓聲音產生劈啪聲。它會讓聲音延遲 1.5 毫秒，短到完全聽不出來。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:42
#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:188
msgctxt "@option:check Auto Level's lift on or off"
msgid "Lift quiet passages"
msgstr "提升小聲段落"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:44
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid "Turns the lifting on or off. It is on for a new block."
msgstr "開啟或關閉提升功能。新區塊預設為開啟。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:45
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"When you turn it off, the lift glides away over a few seconds rather than "
"stopping at once. The limiter stays in place."
msgstr "關閉時，提升量會在幾秒內逐漸消失，而不是立即停止。限制器仍會保留。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:46
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"For most sources the two switches are all you need. The settings under "
"Advanced are for the unusual cases."
msgstr "對大多數來源來說，這兩個開關就足夠了。「進階」中的設定是供特殊情況使用的。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:52
#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:202
msgctxt "@option:check Auto Level's cut on or off"
msgid "Bring loud passages down"
msgstr "降低大聲段落"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:54
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"Turns on bringing sound down towards the target as well. It is off for a new "
"Auto Level and on for a Voice Evener."
msgstr "同時開啟將聲音向目標調低的功能。新的「自動音量」預設為關閉，「人聲均勻器」則為開啟。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:55
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"When you turn it off, a cut glides away over a few seconds rather than "
"stopping at once."
msgstr "關閉時，削減量會在幾秒內逐漸消失，而不是立即停止。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:60
#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:157
msgctxt "@title:group Auto Level's graph"
msgid "Level in and out"
msgstr "輸入與輸出準位"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:62
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"What the settings do, drawn: how loud the sound comes in along the bottom, "
"how loud it goes out up the side, both from −60 to 0 LUFS. The dashed line is"
" sound left unchanged. The dot is the sound now, worked out from the reading "
"and the change, and the limiter is not in it. While the change glides the dot"
" sits off the curve, and a pull drops it below."
msgstr ""
"以圖表呈現設定的效果：底部橫軸是輸入的音量，側邊縱軸是輸出的音量，範圍都是 −60 到 0 "
"LUFS。虛線代表未經改變的聲音。圓點代表目前的聲音，是根據讀數和變化量算出的，不包含限制器的作用。變化量平順過渡期間，圓點會偏離曲線；拉回時，圓點則會落到曲線下方。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:63
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"The numbers under the graph say the same as the dot, and Graph as a table "
"lists the curve with a row for now."
msgstr "圖表下方的數值與圓點表示的內容相同；「以表格顯示圖表」則會列出曲線，並有一列顯示目前的值。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:68
#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:314
msgctxt "@title:group Auto Level's graph as numbers"
msgid "Graph as a table"
msgstr "圖表的表格形式"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"Click the heading to show the curve as numbers: what comes in, what goes out "
"and the change, with a last row for now while the block runs."
msgstr "按一下標題即可以數值顯示曲線：輸入、輸出和變化量；區塊執行時，最後一列會顯示目前的值。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:75
#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:243
msgctxt "@title:group the less usual Auto Level settings"
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "進階"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:77
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"Click Advanced to show or hide these settings. Their values stay on the "
"heading while it is closed. Target loudness and Leave alone work while either"
" switch is on, and each maximum while its own switch is on."
msgstr ""
"按一下「進階」即可顯示或隱藏這些設定。收合時，這些設定的數值會顯示在標題上。只要任一開關開啟，「目標響度」和「不調整範圍」就會作用；各個最大值則在其對應的開關開啟時作用。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:83
#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:254
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Target loudness"
msgstr "目標響度"

#. i18n: LUFS stays in Latin letters in most languages; the sentence explains
#. it.
#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:86
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"How loud the block tries to make the sound. It is measured in LUFS, short for"
" loudness units relative to full scale: a measure of how loud sound seems to "
"the ear. The numbers are below zero, and a number nearer zero is louder."
msgstr ""
"區塊嘗試讓聲音達到的響度。單位是 LUFS，即「相對於滿刻度的響度單位」的縮寫：用來衡量聲音在耳朵聽來有多大聲。數值都在零以下，越接近零越大聲。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:87
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"The slider goes from −30 to −14 LUFS in steps of 1, and you can type the "
"number. A new block aims for −20 LUFS, and a Voice Evener for −23 LUFS."
msgstr ""
"滑桿範圍從 −30 到 −14 LUFS，以 1 為單位調整，也可以直接輸入數值。新區塊的目標是 −20 LUFS，「人聲均勻器」則是 −23 LUFS。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:93
#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:269
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Maximum boost"
msgstr "最大提升"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:95
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"The most the block may lift the sound, however quiet it is. The slider goes "
"from 0 to 24 dB in steps of 1, and a new block allows 18 dB."
msgstr "無論聲音多小聲，區塊最多能提升多少。滑桿範圍從 0 到 24 dB，以 1 為單位調整，新區塊允許 18 dB。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:96
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"Lower it for a noisy source. A lift of 18 dB makes quiet sound about eight "
"times stronger, and it lifts the hiss and hum in the background just as much."
msgstr "來源雜訊多時請調低。提升 18 dB 會讓小聲的聲音強約八倍，背景中的嘶聲和嗡嗡聲也會被同樣提升。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:97
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid "At 0 dB the block lifts nothing at all."
msgstr "設為 0 dB 時，區塊完全不會提升。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:103
#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:284
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Maximum cut"
msgstr "最大削減"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:105
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"The most the block may take off, however loud the sound is. The slider goes "
"from 0 to 24 dB in steps of 1, and a new block allows 18 dB. At 0 dB nothing "
"is turned down."
msgstr ""
"無論聲音多大聲，區塊最多能削減多少。滑桿範圍從 0 到 24 dB，以 1 為單位調整，新區塊允許 18 dB。設為 0 dB 時，不會調低任何聲音。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:111
#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:300
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Leave alone"
msgstr "不調整範圍"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:113
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"How far either side of the target the sound is left as it is, in loudness "
"units (LU). The slider goes from 0 to 6 in steps of 1. A new Auto Level "
"leaves nothing alone and a Voice Evener ±1 LU. At 0 every level is moved to "
"the target."
msgstr ""
"在目標上下多少範圍內的聲音保持原樣，以響度單位（LU）計。滑桿範圍從 0 到 6，以 1 為單位調整。新的「自動音量」沒有不調整範圍，「人聲均勻器」則為 "
"±1 LU。設為 0 時，所有準位都會被移向目標。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:120
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"A speaker moves towards the microphone and away from it, and keeps getting "
"louder and quieter."
msgstr "說話者一下靠近麥克風、一下遠離，聲音忽大忽小。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:121
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"A video or a podcast has quiet passages that are hard to hear over the noise "
"around you."
msgstr "影片或 Podcast 中有些小聲的段落，在周遭的嘈雜聲中很難聽清楚。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:122
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"Several people in a call are at very different levels, and you want them "
"nearer each other: add Voice Evener from the library."
msgstr "通話中幾個人的音量差異很大，您希望讓他們更接近：從區塊庫加入「人聲均勻器」。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:129
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"Start with the switch on and the Advanced settings as they are. Change them "
"only if the result is not what you want."
msgstr "一開始請開啟開關，並保持「進階」設定不變。只有在結果不如預期時才變更它們。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:130
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"If background noise swells up in the quiet parts, lower Maximum boost, or put"
" a Denoise or Speech Denoise block before this one."
msgstr "如果背景雜訊在安靜的部分變大，請調低「最大提升」，或在此區塊之前放一個「降噪」或「語音降噪」區塊。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:131
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"Put a Peak/RMS meter after the block to see the level it gives you, and watch"
" the number on its tile to see what it is doing."
msgstr "在此區塊之後放一個「峰值/RMS」儀表，即可查看它輸出的準位；觀察圖塊上的數值，即可了解它正在做什麼。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelHelp.qml:132
msgctxt "@info help page of the Auto Level block"
msgid ""
"This block evens a talker or a passage over seconds and leaves the rise and "
"fall inside a sentence. To tame what is loud moment by moment, add a "
"compressor after it."
msgstr "此區塊以數秒為尺度讓說話者或段落變得平均，並保留句子內部的抑揚起伏。若要控制每個瞬間的大聲部分，請在它之後加入壓縮器。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:62
msgctxt "@label the live row of Auto Level's table, 'Now -30 LUFS'"
msgid "Now %1"
msgstr "目前 %1"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:80
msgctxt "@info Auto Level when the program in front of it declares music"
msgid ""
"This lane's program says it is playing music. This block takes the loud and "
"soft out of it. Turn it off, or move the program to a lane of its own."
msgstr "此軌道的程式表明正在播放音樂。此區塊會抹平音樂中的強弱起伏。請將它關閉，或將該程式移到獨立的軌道。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:216
msgctxt "@info what Auto Level does"
msgid ""
"Brings quiet passages up and loud ones down towards a steady loudness, and "
"leaves what is near it alone. For voices on a call. On music or a film it "
"takes the loud and soft out: turn it off, or give them a lane of their own."
msgstr ""
"將小聲的段落調高、大聲的調低，趨向穩定的響度，接近該響度的部分則不調整。適用於通話中的人聲。用在音樂或電影上會抹平強弱起伏：請將它關閉，或讓它們使用獨立的軌道。"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:245
msgctxt ""
"@info the four values on the closed Advanced row, '-23 LUFS · 18 · 18 · ±1 "
"LU'"
msgid "%1 · %2 · %3 · %4"
msgstr "%1 · %2 · %3 · %4"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:255
msgctxt "@label the unit of Target loudness"
msgid "LUFS"
msgstr "LUFS"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:270
msgctxt "@label the unit of Maximum boost"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:285
msgctxt "@label the unit of Maximum cut"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:291
msgctxt "@info Maximum cut at 0"
msgid "At 0 dB nothing is turned down"
msgstr "設為 0 dB 時不會調低任何聲音"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:301
msgctxt "@label the unit of Leave alone"
msgid "± LU"
msgstr "± LU"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:307
msgctxt "@info Leave alone at 0"
msgid "At 0 every level is moved to the target"
msgstr "設為 0 時所有準位都會移向目標"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:315
msgctxt "@info the columns of Auto Level's table"
msgid "In, Out, Change"
msgstr "輸入、輸出、變化"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:325
msgctxt "@title:column of Auto Level's table"
msgid "In"
msgstr "輸入"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:331
msgctxt "@title:column of Auto Level's table"
msgid "Out"
msgstr "輸出"

#: blocks/autolevel/ui/AutoLevelPanel.qml:337
msgctxt "@title:column of Auto Level's table"
msgid "Change"
msgstr "變化"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:18
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid ""
"Turns one side of a stereo lane down against the other, so the sound leans "
"towards the left or the right."
msgstr "相對於另一側調低立體聲軌道的其中一側，讓聲音偏向左側或右側。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid ""
"Stereo sound has two sides, left and right, one for each speaker or each ear "
"of your headphones. Balance makes one side quieter, and leaves the other "
"exactly as it arrived."
msgstr "立體聲有左右兩側，分別對應每個喇叭或耳機的每一耳。「平衡」會讓其中一側變小聲，另一側則完全保持原樣。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid ""
"Move it towards the left and the right side gets quieter. Move it towards the"
" right and the left side gets quieter. In the centre both sides pass through "
"unchanged."
msgstr "往左移，右側會變小聲。往右移，左側會變小聲。置中時，兩側都會原樣通過。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid ""
"Each side keeps its own sound: nothing moves from one side to the other. To "
"place a single sound somewhere between the speakers, use the Pan block "
"instead."
msgstr "每一側都保留自己的聲音：不會有聲音從一側移到另一側。若要將單一聲音放在喇叭之間的某個位置，請改用「聲像」區塊。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid ""
"A change glides in over a fiftieth of a second, so moving the slider while "
"sound plays makes no click."
msgstr "變化會在五十分之一秒內平順生效，因此在播放聲音時移動滑桿不會發出喀噠聲。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:36 blocks/balance/ui/BalanceUi.qml:22
#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceUi.qml:29
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Balance"
msgstr "平衡"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:38
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid ""
"Where the balance is set, from L 100 at the left end of the slider, through "
"Centre, to R 100 at the right end. Drag the slider here or on the block's "
"tile; the number shows where it is. A new block starts at Centre."
msgstr ""
"平衡的設定位置，從滑桿左端的「左 100」，經過「置中」，到右端的「右 "
"100」。可在這裡或區塊的圖塊上拖曳滑桿；數值會顯示目前的位置。新區塊的起始位置為「置中」。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid ""
"The number says how much quieter the other side is, in per cent of its "
"strength. At L 30 the right side keeps 70 % of its strength; at L 100 it is "
"silent. The side you move towards never changes."
msgstr ""
"數值表示另一側小聲了多少，以其強度的百分比表示。在「左 30」時，右側保留 70 % 的強度；在「左 "
"100」時，右側則完全無聲。您移往的那一側永遠不會改變。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:46
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid "One side of your headphones or speakers sounds louder than the other."
msgstr "耳機或喇叭的一側聽起來比另一側大聲。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid ""
"You hear better with one ear and want that side quieter, or the other side "
"louder."
msgstr "您的一耳聽力較好，希望那一側小聲一點，或另一側大聲一點。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid ""
"A recording was made with one side louder than the other, and you want it to "
"sound even."
msgstr "錄音的一側比另一側大聲，您希望它聽起來平均。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:55
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid ""
"Move the slider a little at a time while you listen. A few steps are often "
"enough."
msgstr "一邊聆聽，一邊一點一點地移動滑桿。通常移動幾步就夠了。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:56
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid ""
"Balance only turns a side down. To make the whole lane louder again "
"afterwards, put a Volume block after it."
msgstr "「平衡」只會調低一側。若之後要讓整條軌道再次變大聲，請在它之後放一個「音量」區塊。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Balance block"
msgid ""
"To hear one side alone on both speakers, or to swap the sides, use the "
"Channels block."
msgstr "若要在兩個喇叭上只聽某一側，或要交換兩側，請使用「聲道」區塊。"

#: blocks/balance/ui/BalanceUi.qml:21
msgctxt "@label what the setting on a Balance tile is"
msgid "balance"
msgstr "平衡"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleFace.qml:43
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip a Bass & Treble block's settings, 'Bass +3.0 dB, treble -2.0 "
"dB'"
msgid "Bass %1, treble %2"
msgstr "低音 %1，高音 %2"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleFace.qml:139
#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:37
#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTreblePanel.qml:126
msgctxt "@label:slider the low end on a Bass & Treble block"
msgid "Bass"
msgstr "低音"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleFace.qml:147
#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:46
#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTreblePanel.qml:136
msgctxt "@label:slider the high end on a Bass & Treble block"
msgid "Treble"
msgstr "高音"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid ""
"Lifts or cuts the low end and the high end of the sound, to make it warmer, "
"fuller, brighter or softer."
msgstr "提升或衰減聲音的低頻端和高頻端，讓聲音更溫暖、更飽滿、更明亮或更柔和。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid ""
"The bass is the deep part of the sound: a bass drum, a bass guitar, a rumble."
" The treble is the bright part: cymbals, the sparkle and air of a recording, "
"and hiss."
msgstr "低音是聲音中低沉的部分：大鼓、貝斯、隆隆聲。高音是明亮的部分：鈸、錄音中的閃亮感與空氣感，以及嘶聲。"

#. i18n: Hz stands for hertz, kHz for kilohertz.
#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid ""
"Each of the two settings works on its own end. Bass works on the sound below "
"about 100 hertz (Hz), Treble on the sound above about 10 kilohertz (kHz). The"
" change fades in gradually towards each end, so the middle of the range, "
"where voices are, is left alone."
msgstr ""
"這兩項設定各自作用於一端。「低音」作用於約 100 赫茲（Hz）以下的聲音，「高音」作用於約 10 "
"千赫（kHz）以上的聲音。變化會朝兩端逐漸增強，因此人聲所在的中間範圍不受影響。"

#. i18n: dB stands for decibels.
#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid ""
"Both are set in decibels (dB). A higher number lifts that end, a number below"
" zero cuts it, and 0 dB leaves it exactly as it arrived. Every 6 dB is about "
"twice or half the strength."
msgstr "兩者都以分貝（dB）設定。數值越高，該端提升越多；低於零的數值會衰減它；0 dB 則完全維持原樣。每 6 dB 約等於兩倍或一半的強度。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid ""
"A change glides in over a fiftieth of a second, so moving a slider while "
"sound plays makes no click."
msgstr "變更會在五十分之一秒內平順過渡，因此在播放聲音時移動滑桿不會有喀噠聲。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid ""
"Lifts or cuts the low end, from −12 to +12 dB in steps of half a decibel. "
"Lift it to make a thin sound warmer and fuller; cut it to take away boom and "
"rumble."
msgstr "提升或衰減低頻端，範圍從 −12 到 +12 dB，以半分貝為一格。提升可讓單薄的聲音更溫暖飽滿；衰減可去除轟鳴聲和隆隆聲。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:40
#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid ""
"A new block starts at 0 dB. Double-click the slider to put it back there."
msgstr "新區塊從 0 dB 開始。在滑桿上按兩下即可設回該值。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid ""
"Lifts or cuts the high end, from −12 to +12 dB in steps of half a decibel. "
"Lift it to make a dull sound brighter and more open; cut it to soften hiss or"
" a sound that is too bright."
msgstr "提升或衰減高頻端，範圍從 −12 到 +12 dB，以半分貝為一格。提升可讓沉悶的聲音更明亮、更開闊；衰減可柔化嘶聲或過於明亮的聲音。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:56
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid "Music on small speakers sounds thin, or on big ones sounds boomy."
msgstr "音樂在小喇叭上聽起來單薄，或在大喇叭上聽起來轟鳴。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid "A recording sounds dull, or has a hiss you would rather not hear."
msgstr "錄音聽起來沉悶，或有您不想聽到的嘶聲。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid ""
"You want a quick change of tone, without the ten sliders of the 10-Band EQ."
msgstr "您想快速改變音色，又不想用「10 段等化器」的十個滑桿。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:65
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid "Small changes go a long way. Try 3 dB before you try 12."
msgstr "小小的變化就有明顯效果。試 12 dB 之前，請先試試 3 dB。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid ""
"Cutting is often better than lifting: if the sound is too dull, try a little "
"less bass before you add treble."
msgstr "衰減往往比提升更好：如果聲音太沉悶，請先試著稍微減少低音，再考慮增加高音。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:67
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid ""
"A lift makes the sound louder as well. If a meter after the block reaches the"
" red part at the top, turn the lift down, or the sound down before it."
msgstr "提升也會讓聲音變大。如果區塊之後的儀表碰到頂端的紅色部分，請減少提升，或調低進入區塊之前的聲音。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTrebleHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Bass & Treble block"
msgid ""
"Both sliders are on the block's tile too, so you can change the tone without "
"opening the settings."
msgstr "兩個滑桿也都在區塊的圖塊上，因此不必開啟設定就能改變音色。"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTreblePanel.qml:124
msgctxt "@label:slider the low end on a Bass & Treble block"
msgid "Bass:"
msgstr "低音："

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTreblePanel.qml:127
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Lifts or cuts everything below about 100 Hz"
msgstr "提升或衰減約 100 Hz 以下的所有聲音"

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTreblePanel.qml:134
msgctxt "@label:slider the high end on a Bass & Treble block"
msgid "Treble:"
msgstr "高音："

#: blocks/basstreble/ui/BassTreblePanel.qml:137
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Lifts or cuts everything above about 10 kHz"
msgstr "提升或衰減約 10 kHz 以上的所有聲音"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:21
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"Sends the sound that reaches it to an internet radio server, for anyone to "
"listen to, and passes the sound on unchanged."
msgstr "將送達的聲音傳送到網路電台伺服器，讓任何人都能收聽，並將聲音原樣往下傳。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"An internet radio station is a server that listeners connect to. This block "
"is the source that feeds it: it turns the sound into a stream, in the format "
"you choose, and sends it to the server, which hands it on to every listener."
msgstr "網路電台是一台供聽眾連線的伺服器。此區塊就是供應它的來源：它會以您選擇的格式把聲音轉成串流並傳送到伺服器，再由伺服器轉送給每一位聽眾。"

#. i18n: Icecast and SHOUTcast are the names of programs, the same in every
#. language.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:28
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"It works with the two common kinds of radio server, Icecast and SHOUTcast. "
"You need the server's address and a password for it, from whoever runs it."
msgstr "它支援兩種常見的電台伺服器：Icecast 和 SHOUTcast。您需要向伺服器的管理者取得伺服器位址和密碼。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:29
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"The block connects when you start the session, and lets go when you stop it. "
"The sound also goes on through the block as it is, so the lane can carry on "
"to your speakers or a Recorder."
msgstr "區塊會在您啟動工作階段時連線，並在停止時中斷連線。聲音也會原樣通過區塊，因此軌道可以繼續通往喇叭或「錄音器」。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:30
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"The line at the top of its settings says what it is doing: waiting for the "
"session, connecting, on the air with how long for, or what went wrong."
msgstr "設定頂端的那一行會說明它目前的狀態：等待工作階段、正在連線、播出中及已播出多久，或出了什麼問題。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:31
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"If the server or the network goes away, the block tries again after a second,"
" then waits twice as long each time, up to a minute. The sound in between is "
"not kept: when it is back, listeners hear what is playing then."
msgstr ""
"如果伺服器或網路中斷，區塊會在一秒後重試，之後每次等待的時間加倍，最長一分鐘。中斷期間的聲音不會保留：恢復連線後，聽眾聽到的是當時正在播放的內容。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:32
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"Some problems need you instead: a wrong or missing password, a server "
"certificate that is refused, or a format this computer cannot make. The block"
" stops trying until you change the setting, and the line at the top says why."
msgstr ""
"有些問題則需要您處理：密碼錯誤或未設定、伺服器憑證被拒絕，或這台電腦無法產生的格式。區塊會停止重試，直到您變更設定為止，頂端的那一行會說明原因。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:37
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:249
msgctxt "@title:tab a Broadcast block's settings"
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "設定"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"Where the stream goes, and what it sounds like. A change here while it is on "
"the air makes the block connect again, which listeners may hear as a short "
"break."
msgstr "串流要送往哪裡，以及聽起來如何。播出期間在這裡做的變更會讓區塊重新連線，聽眾可能會聽到短暫的中斷。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:45
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:278
msgctxt "@label:listbox the kind of internet radio server"
msgid "Server"
msgstr "伺服器"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"The kind of server: Icecast, what a new block uses, or SHOUTcast. Whoever "
"runs the server can tell you which it is."
msgstr "伺服器的類型：Icecast（新區塊預設使用）或 SHOUTcast。伺服器的管理者可以告訴您是哪一種。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:53
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:303
msgctxt "@label:textbox a server's name or address"
msgid "Host"
msgstr "主機"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:55
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"The server's name or address, such as radio.example.org. A new block says "
"localhost, which is this computer, for a server you run yourself."
msgstr "伺服器的名稱或位址，例如 radio.example.org。新區塊預設為 localhost，也就是這台電腦，適用於您自己架設的伺服器。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:61
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:321
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:338
msgctxt "@label:spinbox a server's port"
msgid "Port"
msgstr "連接埠"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:63
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"The number the server listens on, from 1 to 65535. A new block uses 8000, the"
" usual one. A SHOUTcast server takes its stream on the number after the one "
"you give, as SHOUTcast always does, so give the number its listeners use."
msgstr ""
"伺服器監聽的連接埠號碼，範圍為 1 到 65535。新區塊預設使用常見的 8000。SHOUTcast "
"伺服器一律在您指定號碼的下一個號碼接收串流，因此請填入聽眾使用的號碼。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:69
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:362
msgctxt "@option:check send a stream to its server over TLS"
msgid "Secure connection (TLS)"
msgstr "安全連線（TLS）"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:71
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"For Icecast only: sends the stream, its title and the password encrypted with"
" TLS, as a web browser's https does. Without it they cross the network as "
"they are, which is fine for a server on this computer or your own network, "
"and not for one across the internet. It is off for a new block."
msgstr ""
"僅適用於 Icecast：以 TLS 加密傳送串流、標題和密碼，就像網頁瀏覽器的 https "
"一樣。若不使用，這些資料會原樣在網路上傳送；對於這台電腦或您自己網路中的伺服器沒有問題，但不適合位於網際網路另一端的伺服器。新區塊預設為關閉。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:72
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"A server takes TLS on a port of its own, often 8443, so change the Port too. "
"Whoever runs the server can tell you whether it offers TLS, and on which "
"port. SHOUTcast servers take no TLS, so the box is not offered for them."
msgstr ""
"伺服器會在專用的連接埠接收 TLS 連線，通常是 8443，因此也請變更「連接埠」。伺服器的管理者可以告訴您它是否提供 "
"TLS，以及使用哪個連接埠。SHOUTcast 伺服器不支援 TLS，因此不會為它們提供這個核取方塊。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:73
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"The block checks the server's certificate the way a web browser does: it must"
" be from an authority this computer trusts, made out to the Host you typed, "
"and in date. If it is not, the block does not send the password, stops "
"trying, and the line at the top says which of the three is wrong. There is no"
" way to skip the check. For a server with a certificate of its own making, "
"add that certificate to this computer's trusted ones, as for any other "
"program, then stop the session and start it again: the block reads the "
"trusted certificates afresh and tries again."
msgstr ""
"區塊會像網頁瀏覽器一樣檢查伺服器的憑證：憑證必須由這台電腦信任的憑證授權單位簽發、發給您輸入的「主機」，而且在有效期限內。若不符合，區塊不會傳送密碼並停止重試，頂端的那一行會說明三項中哪一項有問題。這項檢查無法略過。如果伺服器使用自行簽發的憑證，請像對其他程式一樣，將該憑證加入這台電腦信任的憑證中，然後停止工作階段再重新啟動：區塊會重新讀取受信任的憑證並再試一次。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:79
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:393
msgctxt "@label:textbox an Icecast server's mount point"
msgid "Mount point"
msgstr "掛載點"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:81
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"For Icecast only: the name of your stream on the server, which ends the "
"address listeners open. A new block uses /stream. One server can carry "
"several streams, each at a mount point of its own."
msgstr ""
"僅適用於 Icecast：您的串流在伺服器上的名稱，位於聽眾開啟的位址結尾。新區塊預設使用 "
"/stream。一台伺服器可以承載多個串流，各自使用自己的掛載點。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:87
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:411
msgctxt "@label:textbox the user a stream logs in to its server as"
msgid "User"
msgstr "使用者"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:89
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"For Icecast only: the name the block logs in with. It is nearly always "
"source, what a new block uses."
msgstr "僅適用於 Icecast：區塊登入時使用的名稱。幾乎都是 source，也就是新區塊預設使用的名稱。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:95
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:428
msgctxt "@label:textbox the password a stream logs in to its server with"
msgid "Password"
msgstr "密碼"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:96
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:457
msgctxt "@action:button remove a stream's stored password"
msgid "Forget Password"
msgstr "清除密碼"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:98
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"Type the password and press Enter. It is kept in your desktop's password "
"store, never in the session file, so a session you copy or send to somebody "
"carries no password."
msgstr "輸入密碼後按 Enter。密碼會存放在桌面的密碼儲存庫中，絕不會存入工作階段檔案，因此您複製或傳給別人的工作階段不會帶有密碼。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:99
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"The box then empties and says Stored. Type in it again to replace the "
"password. The button beside it forgets the password altogether."
msgstr "接著欄位會清空並顯示「已儲存」。再次在其中輸入即可取代密碼。旁邊的按鈕會完全清除密碼。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:105
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:477
msgctxt "@label:listbox a stream's format"
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:107
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"How the sound is packed for the trip. Each makes it much smaller by leaving "
"out details the ear is unlikely to miss:"
msgstr "聲音傳送前的封裝方式。每一種格式都會省略耳朵不太會察覺的細節，讓資料小很多："

#. i18n: the format names are the same in every language.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:111
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a stream format"
msgid "MP3: what a new block uses. Every player and every server takes it."
msgstr "MP3：新區塊預設使用。所有播放器和伺服器都支援。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:112
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a stream format"
msgid "Opus: the best sound for its size, especially at low bit rates."
msgstr "Opus：以相同大小而言音質最好，在低位元率時尤其明顯。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:113
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a stream format"
msgid "Ogg Vorbis: an open format that most players take."
msgstr "Ogg Vorbis：開放格式，大多數播放器都支援。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:114
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a stream format"
msgid "AAC: smaller than MP3 for the same sound, and played by most phones."
msgstr "AAC：相同音質下比 MP3 小，大多數手機都能播放。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:117
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"If this computer's audio libraries cannot make a format, a line under the "
"list says which."
msgstr "如果這台電腦的音訊函式庫無法產生某種格式，清單下方會有一行說明是哪一種。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:123
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:522
msgctxt "@label:listbox a stream's bit rate"
msgid "Bit rate"
msgstr "位元率"

#. i18n: kbps stands for kilobits per second.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:126
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"How much of the sound each second keeps, from 32 to 320 kilobits a second "
"(kbps). More sounds better, and every listener needs a connection fast enough"
" to take it. A new block uses 128 kbps, plenty for music in MP3."
msgstr ""
"每秒保留多少聲音資料，範圍為每秒 32 到 320 千位元（kbps）。數值越高音質越好，但每位聽眾都需要夠快的連線才能接收。新區塊預設使用 128 "
"kbps，對 MP3 音樂而言已經足夠。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:127
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"The list offers only what the format can do: Ogg Vorbis starts at 48 kbps in "
"stereo and stops at 192 kbps in mono, and Opus in mono stops at 256 kbps."
msgstr ""
"清單只會列出該格式能使用的數值：Ogg Vorbis 立體聲從 48 kbps 起，單聲道最高 192 kbps；Opus 單聲道最高 256 kbps。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:133
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:547
msgctxt "@label stereo or mono"
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "聲道"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:135
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:558
msgctxt "@action:button two channels"
msgid "Stereo"
msgstr "立體聲"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:136
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:567
msgctxt "@action:button one channel, both sides mixed"
msgid "Mono"
msgstr "單聲道"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:139
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"Stereo, what a new block uses, keeps the left and the right side apart. Mono "
"mixes them into one, which is all speech needs and leaves more of the bit "
"rate for the sound itself."
msgstr "「立體聲」（新區塊預設使用）會將左右兩側分開。「單聲道」會把它們混成一個聲道，對說話來說已經足夠，也能把更多位元率留給聲音本身。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:144
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:250
msgctxt "@title:tab a Broadcast block's settings"
msgid "Metadata"
msgstr "中繼資料"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:146
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"What the server and the listeners are told about the station, and the title "
"of what is playing."
msgstr "提供給伺服器和聽眾的電台資訊，以及正在播放內容的標題。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:152
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:595
msgctxt "@label:textbox a radio station's name"
msgid "Station"
msgstr "電台"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:154
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:596
msgctxt "@label:textbox a radio station's genre"
msgid "Genre"
msgstr "類型"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:155
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:597
msgctxt "@label:textbox a radio station's web page"
msgid "Web page"
msgstr "網頁"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:156
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:598
msgctxt "@label:textbox a radio station's description"
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:159
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"The station's name, its genre, the address of its web page and a line "
"describing it. Listeners' players and the server's own pages can show them. "
"All of them can be left empty. A change to them while on the air makes the "
"block connect again."
msgstr "電台的名稱、類型、網頁位址和一行描述。聽眾的播放器和伺服器本身的網頁可以顯示這些資訊。全部都可以留空。播出期間變更這些資訊會讓區塊重新連線。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:165
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:636
msgctxt "@option:check let the server list a station in a public directory"
msgid "List in public directories"
msgstr "列在公開目錄中"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:167
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"Lets the server add the station to the public lists of internet radio, where "
"anyone can find it. It is off for a new block."
msgstr "允許伺服器將電台加入網路電台的公開清單，讓任何人都能找到。新區塊預設為關閉。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:173
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:654
msgctxt "@label:textbox how the title listeners see is made"
msgid "Title"
msgstr "標題"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:175
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"The title listeners see for what is playing. Type your own words, with any of"
" these pieces, which are filled in as the music changes:"
msgstr "聽眾看到的正在播放內容標題。輸入您自己的文字，並可加入下列任何片段，這些片段會隨著音樂變化自動填入："

#. i18n: %artist, %title, %album, %session and %% are typed as they are and
#. must not be translated.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:179
#, c-format
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a piece of the title"
msgid ""
"%artist, %title and %album: the artist, the title and the album of the track "
"that is playing, from Now playing below."
msgstr "%artist、%title 和 %album：正在播放曲目的演出者、標題和專輯，取自下方的「正在播放」。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:180
#, c-format
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a piece of the title"
msgid "%session: the session's name."
msgstr "%session：工作階段的名稱。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:181
#, c-format
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a piece of the title"
msgid "%%: a percent sign."
msgstr "%%：百分比符號。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:184
#, c-format
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"A new block uses %artist - %title. Words between two pieces are left out when"
" either is empty, so a track with no artist shows its title alone, with no "
"dash in front."
msgstr ""
"新區塊預設使用 %artist - "
"%title。兩個片段中只要有一個是空的，它們之間的文字就會省略，因此沒有演出者的曲目只會顯示標題，前面也不會有破折號。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:185
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"Once the stream is on the air, a line at the end of the tab shows the title "
"listeners see now."
msgstr "串流播出後，分頁最下方會有一行顯示聽眾目前看到的標題。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:191
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:131
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/NowPlayingRows.qml:87
msgctxt "@label:listbox where a stream's title comes from"
msgid "Now playing"
msgstr "正在播放"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:193
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:133
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/NowPlayingRows.qml:113
msgctxt "@label:textbox the text file a stream's title is read from"
msgid "File"
msgstr "檔案"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:194
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:134
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/NowPlayingRows.qml:127
msgctxt "@action:button choose the text file a stream's title is read from"
msgid "Choose File…"
msgstr "選擇檔案…"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:195
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:135
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/NowPlayingRows.qml:141
msgctxt "@label:listbox the media player a stream's title follows"
msgid "Player"
msgstr "播放器"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:198
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid "Where the block learns what is playing, for the pieces of the title:"
msgstr "區塊從哪裡得知正在播放的內容，用於填入標題的片段："

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:201
#, c-format
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a choice of Now playing"
msgid ""
"Only the template: nothing is learned, and the title is your own words and "
"%session. What a new block uses."
msgstr "僅使用範本：不取得任何資訊，標題就是您自己的文字和 %session。新區塊預設使用此項。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:202
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a choice of Now playing"
msgid ""
"A text file: the first line of the file is the title. Many music players can "
"write such a file. Type its place in the File box, or choose it with the "
"button beside it. The block looks at the file every second and sends a new "
"title when it changes."
msgstr ""
"文字檔：檔案的第一行就是標題。許多音樂播放器都能寫出這種檔案。在「檔案」欄位輸入它的位置，或用旁邊的按鈕選擇。區塊每秒檢查一次檔案，內容改變時就傳送新標題。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:203
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a choice of Now playing"
msgid ""
"A media player: the block asks a music or video player on this computer what "
"it is playing, with the artist and the album. Choose which in the Player "
"list."
msgstr "媒體播放器：區塊會詢問這台電腦上的音樂或影片播放器正在播放什麼，包括演出者和專輯。在「播放器」清單中選擇要詢問哪一個。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:206
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"The one this session captures, the first choice of Player, follows a player "
"that the session's Application blocks take the sound of, so the title is that"
" of the music listeners hear. In a session that takes no program, such as one"
" with a microphone or System Audio, it follows whichever player is playing. "
"Of several, one that is playing comes before one that is paused, and the one "
"that started last before the others."
msgstr ""
"「播放器」的第一個選項「此工作階段擷取的播放器」會跟隨工作階段中「應用程式」區塊所擷取聲音的播放器，因此標題就是聽眾聽到的音樂。在不擷取任何程式的工作階段中（例如使用麥克風或「系統音訊」的工作階段），它會跟隨正在播放的播放器。有多個播放器時，正在播放的優先於已暫停的，最後開始播放的優先於其他播放器。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:207
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"A player chosen by name is followed whatever the session takes. While it is "
"not running, the list says so and keeps it chosen. When the player stops, "
"only the words of the title that do not need it are left."
msgstr "依名稱選擇的播放器，不論工作階段擷取什麼都會被跟隨。它未執行時，清單會註明並保持選取。播放器停止後，標題中只會留下不需要它的文字。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:212
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:251
msgctxt "@title:tab a Broadcast block's settings"
msgid "Status"
msgstr "狀態"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:214
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"How the stream is going, while the session runs. Nothing here can be changed:"
msgstr "工作階段執行時串流的狀況。這裡的內容都無法變更："

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:217
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid "Connected for: how long it has been on the air this time."
msgstr "已連線時間：這次已經播出多久。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:218
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid ""
"Connection: Secure (TLS) while the stream goes encrypted, Not encrypted while"
" it does not."
msgstr "連線：串流加密傳送時顯示「安全（TLS）」，未加密時顯示「未加密」。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:219
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid "Sent: how much it has sent to the server."
msgstr "已傳送：已經傳送到伺服器的資料量。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:220
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid "Bit rate: the rate it is sending at, as measured."
msgstr "位元率：實際測得的傳送速率。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:221
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid ""
"Reconnects: how many times it had to connect again. A number that keeps "
"growing means a poor connection or a server in trouble."
msgstr "重新連線次數：必須重新連線的次數。如果數字一直增加，表示連線品質不佳或伺服器出了問題。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:222
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid "Last problem: what last went wrong, even once it has been put right."
msgstr "最近的問題：最近一次發生的問題，即使已經解決也會顯示。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:229
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"You run an internet radio station, or a stream for a club, a church or a "
"school, and want to feed it from this computer."
msgstr "您經營網路電台，或為社團、教會或學校提供串流，並想從這台電腦供應聲音。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:230
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"You want to send a live event to listeners who open it in a browser or a "
"radio app."
msgstr "您想把現場活動傳送給在瀏覽器或電台應用程式中收聽的聽眾。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:231
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"You want the music you play here to reach a server with the right titles on "
"it."
msgstr "您想讓在這裡播放的音樂連同正確的標題一起送到伺服器。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:238
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"Put a Peak/RMS meter before the block and keep the level out of the red: "
"listeners hear any crackle too. A Limiter just before it is a good safeguard."
msgstr "在此區塊之前放一個「峰值/RMS」儀表，讓準位不要進入紅色區域：聽眾也會聽到任何劈啪聲。在它前面緊接著放一個「限制器」是很好的保護措施。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:239
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"Before going live, listen to the stream yourself from the server's address, "
"on another device."
msgstr "正式播出前，請先用另一部裝置從伺服器的位址親自收聽串流。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:240
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"If the line at the top says the server refused the user name or password, "
"check the User and the Password. For SHOUTcast, check the port, too."
msgstr "如果頂端那一行顯示伺服器拒絕了使用者名稱或密碼，請檢查「使用者」和「密碼」。若是 SHOUTcast，也請檢查連接埠。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:241
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"If it says no secure connection could be made, the port is most likely the "
"server's plain one: ask for its TLS port. If it says the certificate is for "
"another name, type the Host as the server's certificate names it, usually its"
" full name rather than its address."
msgstr ""
"如果顯示無法建立安全連線，連接埠很可能是伺服器的一般連接埠：請詢問它的 TLS "
"連接埠。如果顯示憑證屬於其他名稱，請依伺服器憑證上的名稱輸入「主機」，通常是完整名稱而不是位址。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastHelp.qml:242
msgctxt "@info help page of the Broadcast block"
msgid ""
"If your connection is slow, choose a lower bit rate, or Mono for speech, "
"before you lower anything else."
msgstr "如果您的連線速度較慢，請先選擇較低的位元率，或為說話內容選擇「單聲道」，再考慮降低其他設定。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:287
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Server"
msgstr "伺服器"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:311
msgctxt "@info:placeholder"
msgid "radio.example.org"
msgstr "radio.example.org"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:312
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Host"
msgstr "主機"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:382
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"A server takes TLS on a port of its own, often 8443. Ask whoever runs it."
msgstr "伺服器會在專用的連接埠接收 TLS 連線，通常是 8443。請詢問伺服器的管理者。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:383
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Without it, the password and the stream cross the network unencrypted."
msgstr "若不使用，密碼和串流會以未加密的方式在網路上傳送。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:401
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Mount point"
msgstr "掛載點"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:419
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "User"
msgstr "使用者"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:440
msgctxt "@info:placeholder a password is stored; typing replaces it"
msgid "Stored. Type a new one to replace it."
msgstr "已儲存。輸入新密碼即可取代。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:441
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:352
msgctxt "@info:placeholder"
msgid "Not set"
msgstr "未設定"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:442
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Password"
msgstr "密碼"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:446
msgctxt "@info a password field, as a screen reader reads it"
msgid "Password for the server"
msgstr "伺服器的密碼"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:469
msgctxt "@info where a stream's password is kept"
msgid "Kept in your system's password store, never in the session file."
msgstr "存放在系統的密碼儲存庫中，絕不會存入工作階段檔案。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:487
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:443
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:513
msgctxt "@info %1 is a list of formats"
msgid "This system's FFmpeg can't make %1."
msgstr "此系統的 FFmpeg 無法產生 %1。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:530
msgctxt "@item a bit rate"
msgid "%1 kbps"
msgstr "%1 kbps"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:531
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:483
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Bit rate"
msgstr "位元率"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:662
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:443
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Title"
msgstr "標題"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:668
#, c-format
msgctxt "@info the tokens of a stream's title; keep the %-words as they are"
msgid ""
"%artist, %title and %album are what is playing; %session is the session's "
"name."
msgstr "%artist、%title 和 %album 是正在播放的內容；%session 是工作階段的名稱。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:683
msgctxt "@info %1 is the title a stream's listeners see now"
msgid "Listeners see: %1"
msgstr "聽眾看到：%1"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:699
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:588
msgctxt "@label how long a stream has been connected"
msgid "Connected for"
msgstr "已連線時間"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:709
msgctxt "@label whether a stream's connection is encrypted"
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "連線"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:719
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:596
msgctxt "@label how much a stream has sent to its server"
msgid "Sent"
msgstr "已傳送"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:729
msgctxt "@label the rate a stream is going out at, measured"
msgid "Bit rate"
msgstr "位元率"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:736
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:613
msgctxt "@info a measured bit rate"
msgid "%1 kbps"
msgstr "%1 kbps"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:741
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:643
msgctxt "@label how many times a stream connected again"
msgid "Reconnects"
msgstr "重新連線次數"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastPanel.qml:751
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:653
msgctxt "@label what last went wrong with a stream"
msgid "Last problem"
msgstr "最近的問題"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:34
msgctxt "@item a kind of internet radio server"
msgid "Icecast"
msgstr "Icecast"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:36
msgctxt "@item a kind of internet radio server"
msgid "SHOUTcast"
msgstr "SHOUTcast"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:44
msgctxt "@item a stream's format"
msgid "MP3"
msgstr "MP3"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:46
msgctxt "@item a stream's format"
msgid "Opus"
msgstr "Opus"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:48
msgctxt "@item a stream's format"
msgid "Ogg Vorbis"
msgstr "Ogg Vorbis"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:50
msgctxt "@item a stream's format"
msgid "AAC"
msgstr "AAC"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:58
msgctxt "@item where a stream's title comes from"
msgid "Only the template"
msgstr "僅使用範本"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:60
msgctxt "@item where a stream's title comes from"
msgid "A text file"
msgstr "文字檔"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:62
msgctxt "@item where a stream's title comes from"
msgid "A media player"
msgstr "媒體播放器"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:73
msgctxt "@item the media player a stream's title follows"
msgid "The one this session captures"
msgstr "此工作階段擷取的播放器"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:79
msgctxt "@item %1 is a media player that is not running now"
msgid "%1 (not running)"
msgstr "%1（未執行）"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:89
msgctxt "@info a stream's connection"
msgid "Secure (TLS)"
msgstr "安全（TLS）"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:90
msgctxt "@info a stream's connection"
msgid "Not encrypted"
msgstr "未加密"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:97
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "On the air"
msgstr "播出中"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:99
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "Connecting…"
msgstr "正在連線…"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:101
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "Getting the password…"
msgstr "正在取得密碼…"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:104
msgctxt "@info:status a stream; %2 says why"
msgid "%2. Trying again in %1 second…"
msgid_plural "%2. Trying again in %1 seconds…"
msgstr[0] "%2。%1 秒後重試…"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:110
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "Starts when the session runs"
msgstr "工作階段執行時開始"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:117
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server refused the user name or password"
msgstr "伺服器拒絕了使用者名稱或密碼"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:119
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "No password is set"
msgstr "未設定密碼"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:121
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "No server is set"
msgstr "未設定伺服器"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:123
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "This system can't make this format"
msgstr "此系統無法產生這種格式"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:125
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The encoder stopped"
msgstr "編碼器已停止"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:127
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server's name wasn't found"
msgstr "找不到伺服器的名稱"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:129
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server isn't answering"
msgstr "伺服器沒有回應"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:131
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server took too long"
msgstr "伺服器回應逾時"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:133
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server closed the connection"
msgstr "伺服器關閉了連線"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:135
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The mount point is in use"
msgstr "掛載點已在使用中"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:138
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server refused the stream"
msgstr "伺服器拒絕了串流"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:140
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server's certificate isn't from an authority this computer trusts"
msgstr "伺服器的憑證並非由這台電腦信任的憑證授權單位簽發"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:142
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server's certificate has expired, or isn't valid yet"
msgstr "伺服器的憑證已過期或尚未生效"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:144
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server's certificate is for another name than the host"
msgstr "伺服器的憑證所屬名稱與主機不符"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:146
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server's certificate was refused"
msgstr "伺服器的憑證被拒絕"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:148
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The server offers no secure connection this computer accepts"
msgstr "伺服器沒有提供這台電腦接受的安全連線"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:150
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The secure connection broke off"
msgstr "安全連線中斷了"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:152
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "This computer's trusted certificate authorities couldn't be read"
msgstr "無法讀取這台電腦信任的憑證授權單位"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/BroadcastWords.qml:154
msgctxt "@info:status a stream"
msgid "The stream stopped"
msgstr "串流已停止"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Sends the sound that reaches it to a video streaming service, with a picture "
"made for it, and passes the sound on unchanged."
msgstr "將送達的聲音連同為它製作的畫面傳送到影音串流服務，並將聲音原樣往下傳。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Services that take a live stream expect video, even for a radio show or a set"
" of music. So the block draws a picture for the sound: a title, a line or two"
" of words, what is playing, and something that moves with the sound, over a "
"colour or a picture of your own."
msgstr ""
"接收直播的服務都要求視訊，即使是廣播節目或一段音樂也一樣。因此區塊會為聲音繪製畫面：標題、一兩行文字、正在播放的內容，以及隨聲音律動的圖形，背景可以是一種顏色或您自己的圖片。"

#. i18n: RTMP and RTMPS are the names of protocols, the same in every language.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:29
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"It sends both to the service over RTMP or RTMPS, the way most streaming "
"services take a live stream. You need the service's address and your stream "
"key, from the service's page for going live."
msgstr ""
"它會透過 RTMP 或 RTMPS 將兩者傳送到服務，大多數串流服務都是以這種方式接收直播。您需要從服務的直播頁面取得服務的位址和您的串流金鑰。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:30
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The block connects when you start the session and lets go when you stop it. "
"The sound also goes on through the block as it is, so the lane can carry on "
"to your speakers or a Recorder."
msgstr "區塊會在您啟動工作階段時連線，並在停止時中斷連線。聲音也會原樣通過區塊，因此軌道可以繼續通往喇叭或「錄音器」。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:31
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The picture keeps time with the sound however long the stream runs. If the "
"computer is too busy to draw every frame, it leaves some out rather than let "
"the sound wait."
msgstr "無論串流持續多久，畫面都會與聲音保持同步。如果電腦太忙而無法繪製每一個影格，它會略過一些影格，而不會讓聲音等待。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:32
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The line at the top of its settings says what it is doing. If the service or "
"the network goes away, the block tries again after a second, then waits twice"
" as long each time, up to a minute. A missing stream key, or a computer that "
"cannot make the video, stops it until you change something."
msgstr ""
"設定頂端的那一行會說明它目前的狀態。如果服務或網路中斷，區塊會在一秒後重試，之後每次等待的時間加倍，最長一分鐘。若未設定串流金鑰，或電腦無法產生視訊，它會停止，直到您做出變更為止。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:37
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:285
msgctxt "@title:tab a Live Stream block's settings"
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "設定"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Where the stream goes, and how big its picture is. A change here while it is "
"on the air makes the block connect again."
msgstr "串流要送往哪裡，以及畫面有多大。播出期間在這裡做的變更會讓區塊重新連線。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:45
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:321
msgctxt "@label:textbox a video service's RTMP address"
msgid "Server"
msgstr "伺服器"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The service's address for live streams, copied as the service gives it. It "
"starts with rtmps:// or rtmp://. A new block has none, so nothing is sent "
"anywhere until you fill it in."
msgstr "服務的直播位址，請照服務提供的內容複製。開頭是 rtmps:// 或 rtmp://。新區塊沒有預設位址，因此在您填入之前不會傳送任何內容。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Choose the rtmps:// address where the service offers one. The stream is then "
"encrypted on its way, and the block checks that the server is really the one "
"named."
msgstr "如果服務有提供 rtmps:// 位址，請選擇它。如此串流在傳送途中會加密，區塊也會確認伺服器確實是所指名的那一台。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:54
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:340
msgctxt "@label:textbox the secret key a video service gives for streaming"
msgid "Stream key"
msgstr "串流金鑰"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:55
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:368
msgctxt "@action:button remove a live stream's stored key"
msgid "Forget Stream Key"
msgstr "清除串流金鑰"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The secret code that tells the service the stream is yours. Paste it and "
"press Enter. Anyone who has it can stream on your channel, so keep it to "
"yourself."
msgstr "讓服務知道串流屬於您的秘密代碼。貼上後按 Enter。任何擁有它的人都能在您的頻道上直播，所以請不要外流。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"It is kept in your desktop's password store, never in the session file. The "
"box then empties and says Stored; type in it again to replace the key. The "
"button beside it forgets the key altogether."
msgstr ""
"金鑰會存放在桌面的密碼儲存庫中，絕不會存入工作階段檔案。接著欄位會清空並顯示「已儲存」；再次在其中輸入即可取代金鑰。旁邊的按鈕會完全清除金鑰。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:64
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:388
msgctxt "@label:listbox a live stream's size and frame rate"
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "品質"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"How big the picture is, and how many times a second it changes. A bigger "
"picture needs a faster upload:"
msgstr "畫面有多大，以及每秒變化幾次。畫面越大，需要的上傳速度越快："

#. i18n: kbps stands for kilobits per second.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Quality"
msgid ""
"Good: 1024 × 576, 15 frames a second. For a slow connection; it sends about "
"900 kbps in all."
msgstr "良好：1024 × 576，每秒 15 影格。適合較慢的連線；總共約傳送 900 kbps。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:71
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Quality"
msgid ""
"Higher: 1280 × 720, 30 frames a second, what a new block uses. It sends about"
" 2,600 kbps."
msgstr "較高：1280 × 720，每秒 30 影格，新區塊預設使用。約傳送 2,600 kbps。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:72
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Quality"
msgid "Best: 1920 × 1080, 30 frames a second. It sends about 4,800 kbps."
msgstr "最佳：1920 × 1080，每秒 30 影格。約傳送 4,800 kbps。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:75
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The better the quality, the better the sound as well: Best sends the sound at"
" 320 kbps, Higher at 128 and Good at 96."
msgstr "品質越好，音質也越好：「最佳」以 320 kbps 傳送聲音，「較高」為 128，「良好」為 96。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:81
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:407
msgctxt "@label:listbox what makes a live stream's video"
msgid "Encoder"
msgstr "編碼器"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:83
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"What turns the pictures into video. The list offers only the ones that work "
"on this computer:"
msgstr "把畫面轉成視訊的元件。清單只會列出在這台電腦上能使用的編碼器："

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:86
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Encoder"
msgid ""
"The best one here: what a new block uses. It tries the graphics card first, "
"then the others."
msgstr "最佳可用編碼器：新區塊預設使用。它會先嘗試顯示卡，再嘗試其他編碼器。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:87
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Encoder"
msgid ""
"A graphics card: the card does the work, which costs the processor almost "
"nothing."
msgstr "顯示卡：由顯示卡負責工作，幾乎不佔用處理器資源。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:88
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Encoder"
msgid ""
"x264 and OpenH264: the processor does the work, which can keep a slow "
"computer busy."
msgstr "x264 和 OpenH264：由處理器負責工作，可能讓較慢的電腦忙碌不堪。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:91
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"If the encoder you chose will not start, the block uses the next one that "
"does. If none works, a line at the top of the tab says what to install."
msgstr "如果您選擇的編碼器無法啟動，區塊會改用下一個能啟動的編碼器。如果都無法使用，分頁頂端會有一行說明需要安裝什麼。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:96
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:286
msgctxt "@title:tab a Live Stream block's settings"
msgid "Picture"
msgstr "畫面"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:98
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"What the picture shows. A change here only redraws it; the stream goes on."
msgstr "畫面上顯示的內容。在這裡做的變更只會重新繪製畫面，串流會繼續進行。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:104
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:435
msgctxt "@label:textbox the large words on a live stream's picture"
msgid "Title"
msgstr "標題"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:106
#, c-format
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The large words on the picture. A new block shows the session's name, which "
"is what %session stands for; type your own words instead."
msgstr "畫面上的大字。新區塊會顯示工作階段的名稱，也就是 %session 代表的內容；您可以改輸入自己的文字。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:112
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:452
msgctxt "@label:textbox the words under a live stream's title"
msgid "Subtitle"
msgstr "副標題"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:114
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"A smaller line under the title, such as the name of the show or when it is "
"on. Leave it empty for none."
msgstr "標題下方較小的一行字，例如節目名稱或播出時間。留空則不顯示。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:120
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:468
msgctxt ""
"@label:textbox how what is playing is shown on a live stream's picture"
msgid "Now playing as"
msgstr "正在播放顯示為"

#. i18n: %artist, %title, %album and %session are typed as they are and must
#. not be translated.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:123
#, c-format
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The line that says what is playing. Type your own words with the pieces "
"%artist, %title and %album, filled in from Now playing below, and %session, "
"the session's name. A new block uses %artist - %title."
msgstr ""
"說明正在播放內容的那一行。輸入您自己的文字，可搭配片段 %artist、%title 和 %album（由下方的「正在播放」填入），以及 "
"%session（工作階段的名稱）。新區塊預設使用 %artist - %title。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:124
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Words between two pieces are left out when either is empty, so a track with "
"no artist shows its title alone. When nothing is known, the line is left off "
"the picture."
msgstr "兩個片段中只要有一個是空的，它們之間的文字就會省略，因此沒有演出者的曲目只會顯示標題。完全沒有資訊時，畫面上就不會顯示這一行。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:125
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Once the stream is on the air, a line under Now playing shows what the "
"picture says now."
msgstr "串流播出後，「正在播放」下方會有一行顯示畫面目前的文字。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:138
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid "Where the block learns what is playing, as a Broadcast block does:"
msgstr "區塊從哪裡得知正在播放的內容，方式與「廣播」區塊相同："

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:141
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Now playing"
msgid "Only the template: nothing is learned. What a new block uses."
msgstr "僅使用範本：不取得任何資訊。新區塊預設使用此項。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:142
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Now playing"
msgid ""
"A text file: its first line is the title. Many music players can write such a"
" file. Type its place in the File box, or choose it with the button beside "
"it."
msgstr "文字檔：第一行就是標題。許多音樂播放器都能寫出這種檔案。在「檔案」欄位輸入它的位置，或用旁邊的按鈕選擇。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:143
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Now playing"
msgid ""
"A media player: the block asks a player on this computer what it is playing. "
"The one this session captures follows a player whose sound the session's "
"Application blocks take, or whichever is playing when they take none. Or "
"choose a player by name."
msgstr ""
"媒體播放器：區塊會詢問這台電腦上的播放器正在播放什麼。「此工作階段擷取的播放器」會跟隨工作階段中「應用程式」區塊所擷取聲音的播放器；若它們沒有擷取任何播放器，則跟隨正在播放的那一個。您也可以依名稱選擇播放器。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:149
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:506
msgctxt "@label:listbox what moves with the sound in a live stream's picture"
msgid "Moving"
msgstr "動態顯示"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:151
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"What moves with the sound, under the words, so viewers can see the stream is "
"live:"
msgstr "文字下方隨聲音律動的圖形，讓觀眾看得出串流正在直播："

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:154
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Moving"
msgid ""
"Waveform: the shape of the sound as a moving line. What a new block shows."
msgstr "波形：以移動的線條呈現聲音的形狀。新區塊預設顯示此項。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:155
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Moving"
msgid "Spectrum: bars that rise and fall with the low, middle and high sounds."
msgstr "頻譜：隨著低、中、高音起伏的長條。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:156
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Moving"
msgid "Level meter: a bar across for each side, showing how loud it is."
msgstr "準位表：每一側各有一條橫向長條，顯示音量大小。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:157
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a choice of Moving"
msgid "Nothing: a still picture."
msgstr "無：靜態畫面。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:163
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:525
msgctxt "@label:textbox a live stream's background colour"
msgid "Background"
msgstr "背景"

#. i18n: keep the colour code #16181d as it is.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:166
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The colour behind everything, as a colour code: a # and six letters and "
"numbers, such as #16181d, the dark grey a new block uses. The square beside "
"the box shows the colour."
msgstr "所有內容後方的顏色，以色碼表示：一個 # 加上六個字母和數字，例如新區塊預設使用的深灰色 #16181d。欄位旁的方塊會顯示該顏色。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:172
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:551
msgctxt "@label:textbox a picture covering a live stream's frame"
msgid "Background picture"
msgstr "背景圖片"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:173
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:210
msgctxt "@action:button choose a picture for a live stream"
msgid "Choose Picture…"
msgstr "選擇圖片…"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:175
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"A picture to cover the whole frame instead of the colour. Type the file's "
"place, or choose it with the button beside the box. Leave it empty for none."
msgstr "用來覆蓋整個畫面、取代背景顏色的圖片。輸入檔案的位置，或用欄位旁的按鈕選擇。留空則不使用。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:181
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:558
msgctxt "@label:textbox a picture at the corner of a live stream's frame"
msgid "Logo"
msgstr "標誌"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:183
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"A small picture at the top left, such as the logo of your show. Choose it as "
"you choose the background picture."
msgstr "顯示在左上角的小圖片，例如您節目的標誌。選擇方式與背景圖片相同。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:184
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"The words are light or dark, whichever reads best over what is behind them, "
"with a shade around them so that a busy picture does not swallow them."
msgstr "文字會依背後的內容自動採用淺色或深色，以最容易閱讀者為準，並帶有陰影，讓雜亂的圖片不會蓋過文字。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:189
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:287
msgctxt "@title:tab a Live Stream block's settings"
msgid "Status"
msgstr "狀態"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:191
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"How the stream is going, while the session runs. Nothing here can be changed:"
msgstr "工作階段執行時串流的狀況。這裡的內容都無法變更："

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:194
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid ""
"Connected for, Sent and Upload: how long it has been on the air, how much it "
"has sent, and at what rate."
msgstr "已連線時間、已傳送和上傳：已經播出多久、傳送了多少資料，以及傳送速率。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:195
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid "Video: the picture's size, its frames a second and the encoder at work."
msgstr "視訊：畫面大小、每秒影格數，以及正在使用的編碼器。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:196
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid ""
"Frames: how many frames it has sent, and how many it left out because the "
"computer fell behind. If that second number keeps growing, choose a lower "
"quality or another encoder."
msgstr "影格：已傳送的影格數，以及因電腦跟不上而略過的影格數。如果第二個數字一直增加，請選擇較低的品質或其他編碼器。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:197
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block, a line of the Status tab"
msgid ""
"Reconnects and Last problem: how many times it had to connect again, and what"
" last went wrong."
msgstr "重新連線次數和最近的問題：必須重新連線的次數，以及最近一次發生的問題。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:204
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"You want to stream a radio show, a podcast or music to a video service, with "
"no camera."
msgstr "您想在沒有攝影機的情況下，將廣播節目、Podcast 或音樂直播到影音服務。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:205
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid "You want viewers to see the title of each song as it plays."
msgstr "您想讓觀眾在每首歌播放時看到歌名。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:212
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"If the service lets you stream privately first, try it there, and watch it on"
" another device, before you go public."
msgstr "如果服務允許先以私人方式直播，請在公開之前先在那裡試播，並用另一部裝置觀看。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:213
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Put a Peak/RMS meter before the block and keep the level out of the red: "
"viewers hear any crackle too."
msgstr "在此區塊之前放一個「峰值/RMS」儀表，讓準位不要進入紅色區域：觀眾也會聽到任何劈啪聲。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:214
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"Start with Higher. If the Frames line on the Status tab shows frames left "
"out, or your connection struggles, choose Good."
msgstr "先從「較高」開始。如果「狀態」分頁的「影格」那一行顯示有影格被略過，或您的連線吃力，請選擇「良好」。"

#. i18n: openh264 is the name of a package, typed as it is.
#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamHelp.qml:216
msgctxt "@info help page of the Live Stream block"
msgid ""
"If the computer has no encoder that works, install Cisco's OpenH264, on "
"Fedora the openh264 package, or the full FFmpeg."
msgstr "如果電腦沒有可用的編碼器，請安裝 Cisco 的 OpenH264（Fedora 上為 openh264 套件），或完整版 FFmpeg。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:203
msgctxt "@info:placeholder a picture file"
msgid "None"
msgstr "無"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:313
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This system has no H.264 encoder that works, so it can't stream video. "
"Install Cisco's OpenH264 (on Fedora, the openh264 package), or the full "
"FFmpeg."
msgstr ""
"此系統沒有可用的 H.264 編碼器，因此無法串流視訊。請安裝 Cisco 的 OpenH264（Fedora 上為 openh264 套件），或完整版 "
"FFmpeg。"

#: blocks/broadcast/ui/LiveStreamPanel.qml:329
msgctxt "@info:placeholder the start of an RTMP address; keep it as it is"
msgid "rtmps://…"
msgstr "rtmps://…"

