msgid "Not running"
msgstr "未執行"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixFace.qml:36
msgctxt "@info what comes out of a One Ear Mix that is switched off"
msgid "Stereo, as it came"
msgstr "立體聲，維持原樣"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixFace.qml:39
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix whose session is not running"
msgid "Session stopped"
msgstr "工作階段已停止"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixFace.qml:64
msgctxt "@info what a One Ear Mix tile says, 'Left ear, L+R one mix to L'"
msgid "%1, %2"
msgstr "%1，%2"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Puts both sides of a stereo mix into the ear you choose, or one mix on both "
"sides for one earbud."
msgstr "將立體聲混音的兩側放進您選擇的耳朵，或在兩側放同一個混音，供只戴一邊耳機時使用。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Without it, what is panned to the other side is lost to the ear you use. A "
"plain mono mix, such as Mono in the Channels block, drops a sound panned to "
"one side by 6 dB, and cancels sound that is out of phase between the sides."
msgstr ""
"沒有它的話，偏向另一側的聲音，您使用的那隻耳朵就聽不到。一般的單聲道混音（例如「聲道」區塊中的「單聲道」）會讓偏向一側的聲音降低 6 "
"dB，並抵消兩側之間反相的聲音。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"One Ear Mix first shifts the two sides a quarter of a cycle apart, then adds "
"them. A sound panned to one side comes through 3 dB lower, and sound out of "
"phase between the sides doesn't cancel the way it does in a plain mono mix."
msgstr ""
"「單耳混音」會先讓兩側錯開四分之一週期，再將它們相加。偏向一側的聲音只會低 3 dB，而兩側之間反相的聲音也不會像一般單聲道混音那樣互相抵消。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"When you pick an ear, the sound on that side goes on playing and what was on "
"the other side comes in over about five seconds. It does the same when the "
"session starts, when the block is switched back on, and when the sound "
"reaches a new output, such as a headset plugged in."
msgstr ""
"選擇某一耳後，那一側的聲音會繼續播放，原本在另一側的聲音則會在大約五秒內逐漸加入。工作階段啟動、區塊重新開啟，以及聲音送到新的輸出（例如插上耳機）時，也會這樣做。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:29
msgctxt "@title a part of the One Ear Mix block's help page"
msgid "What it cannot do"
msgstr "它做不到的事"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:31
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:416
msgctxt "@action:button show the figures behind the line beside it"
msgid "Figures"
msgstr "數據"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:34
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Direction doesn't come back: a mix in one ear can't tell you where a sound "
"is."
msgstr "方向感無法恢復：單耳中的混音無法告訴您聲音來自哪裡。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:35
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"A sound a quarter of a cycle apart between the sides can get quieter. If a "
"track goes thin at one place, try Plain Mono."
msgstr "兩側之間相差四分之一週期的聲音可能會變小聲。如果某首曲目在某處聽起來變得單薄，請試試「一般單聲道」。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:36
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Peaks can rise by several dB, so keep a limit after this block, as Volume "
"has."
msgstr "峰值可能升高數 dB，因此請在此區塊之後保留一道限制，「音量」區塊就有這種限制。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:37
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"If the block is switched off or the session stops, stereo comes back, and "
"what is on the other side is lost to that ear again."
msgstr "如果區塊已關閉或工作階段停止，就會恢復立體聲，那隻耳朵又會聽不到另一側的聲音。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:42
msgctxt "@title a part of the One Ear Mix block's help page"
msgid "What each mix does to sound"
msgstr "各種混音對聲音的影響"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:44
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid "Centred sound: Plain Mono 0 dB, One Ear Mix about 0 dB."
msgstr "置中的聲音：一般單聲道 0 dB，單耳混音約 0 dB。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:45
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid "Sound on one side only: Plain Mono 6 dB lower, One Ear Mix 3 dB lower."
msgstr "僅在單側的聲音：一般單聲道低 6 dB，單耳混音低 3 dB。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:46
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid ""
"Sound out of phase between the sides: Plain Mono cancels it, One Ear Mix "
"about 0 dB."
msgstr "兩側之間反相的聲音：一般單聲道會將其抵消，單耳混音約 0 dB。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid "Unrelated left and right: Plain Mono 3 dB lower, One Ear Mix 0 dB."
msgstr "左右互不相關：一般單聲道低 3 dB，單耳混音 0 dB。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid "Peaks: no rise in Plain Mono, several dB in One Ear Mix."
msgstr "峰值：一般單聲道不會升高，單耳混音會升高數 dB。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid ""
"At 1 kHz and a 48 kHz rate, the right side leading the left by a quarter of a"
" cycle: Plain Mono 3 dB lower, One Ear Mix 30 dB lower."
msgstr "在 1 kHz、取樣率 48 kHz 下，右側比左側超前四分之一週期：一般單聲道低 3 dB，單耳混音低 30 dB。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:50
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block, one row of a table"
msgid ""
"The same with the right side lagging: Plain Mono 3 dB lower, One Ear Mix 3 dB"
" higher."
msgstr "同樣條件但右側落後：一般單聲道低 3 dB，單耳混音高 3 dB。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:60
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:172
msgctxt "@label which ear a One Ear Mix sends the sound to"
msgid "Send to"
msgstr "送往"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:62
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:24
msgctxt "@option:radio One Ear Mix leaves both sides alone"
msgid "No change"
msgstr "不變更"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:63
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:26
msgctxt "@option:radio One Ear Mix sends the sound to"
msgid "Left ear"
msgstr "左耳"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:64
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:28
msgctxt "@option:radio One Ear Mix sends the sound to"
msgid "Right ear"
msgstr "右耳"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:65
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:30
msgctxt "@option:radio One Ear Mix sends the sound to"
msgid "Both ears"
msgstr "雙耳"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"No change passes both sides as they came, and a new block starts there. Left "
"ear and Right ear put both sides into that ear and leave the other side "
"silent. Both ears puts one mix on both sides, for one earbud."
msgstr ""
"「不變更」會讓兩側原樣通過，新區塊也從這裡開始。「左耳」和「右耳」會把兩側都放進該耳，另一側則保持無聲。「雙耳」會在兩側放同一個混音，供只戴一邊耳機時使用。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:74
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:273
msgctxt "@label which of two mixes to listen to"
msgid "Hear"
msgstr "聆聽"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:76
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:265
msgctxt "@title:group a part of the One Ear Mix card"
msgid "Compare with Plain Mono"
msgstr "與一般單聲道比較"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:77
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:42
msgctxt "@option:radio which mix a One Ear Mix block plays"
msgid "One Ear Mix"
msgstr "單耳混音"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:78
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:44
msgctxt "@option:radio which mix a One Ear Mix block plays"
msgid "Plain Mono"
msgstr "一般單聲道"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:81
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Switches between One Ear Mix and Plain Mono, which adds the sides and halves "
"them. It is under Compare with Plain Mono. Plain Mono is also the better "
"choice for a mono recording in two channels."
msgstr ""
"在「單耳混音」與「一般單聲道」之間切換；「一般單聲道」會把兩側相加後減半。它位於「與一般單聲道比較」之下。對於以兩個聲道錄製的單聲道錄音，「一般單聲道」也是較好的選擇。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:87
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:314
msgctxt "@action:button read both mixes and lower the louder"
msgid "Match Levels"
msgstr "匹配準位"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:89
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:313
msgctxt "@action:button a One Ear Mix is reading the two levels"
msgid "Reading, 3 s"
msgstr "測量中，3 秒"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:92
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Play something and press it. It reads both mixes for three seconds. One Ear "
"Mix usually reads louder, and by how much depends on the music, so if it was "
"the louder, the difference goes into Lower this mix by. If Plain Mono was the"
" louder, or the two are more than 6 dB apart, the card says so and changes "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"播放一些聲音，然後按下它。它會測量兩種混音三秒鐘。「單耳混音」通常測得較大聲，大多少則取決於音樂，因此如果它較大聲，差值就會填入「將此混音降低」。如果「一般單聲道」較大聲，或兩者相差超過"
" 6 dB，卡片會加以說明，且不做任何變更。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:98
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:337
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:346
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:373
msgctxt "@label:slider how far a One Ear Mix turns its mix down"
msgid "Lower this mix by"
msgstr "將此混音降低"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:100
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Turns One Ear Mix down, from 0 to 6 dB, so that a comparison is about the "
"sound and not the level. A new block starts at 0 dB. The tile shows it while "
"it is above 0, so that it isn't forgotten. It never touches Plain Mono."
msgstr ""
"把「單耳混音」調低 0 到 6 dB，讓比較的是聲音本身，而不是音量大小。新區塊從 0 dB 開始。只要它高於 "
"0，圖塊上就會顯示，以免被遺忘。它絕不會影響「一般單聲道」。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:107
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid "You want all of a stereo mix in one ear."
msgstr "您希望在單耳中聽到完整的立體聲混音。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:108
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid "You have one earbud in, and want all of the mix in it."
msgstr "您只戴了一邊耳機，希望從中聽到完整的混音。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:115
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"Put it after anything that needs the two sides, just before a lane forks."
msgstr "請把它放在所有需要兩側聲音的區塊之後，緊接在軌道分岔之前。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:116
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid ""
"A Hearing Compensation block set to the same ear, after it, works on what "
"that ear receives."
msgstr "在它之後放一個設為同一耳的「聽力補償」區塊，就能處理該耳實際收到的聲音。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixHelp.qml:117
msgctxt "@info help page of the One Ear Mix block"
msgid "Set Lower this mix by back to 0 when you are done comparing."
msgstr "比較完畢後，請把「將此混音降低」設回 0。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:133
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix's reading was cut short"
msgid "The session stopped, so nothing was measured."
msgstr "工作階段已停止，因此沒有測量任何東西。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:142
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix's reading never ended"
msgid "No reading came back, so nothing was changed."
msgstr "沒有傳回測量結果，因此沒有做任何變更。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:215
msgctxt "@title a table on the One Ear Mix card"
msgid "What each mix does to sound"
msgstr "各種混音對聲音的影響"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:226
msgctxt "@title:column a kind of sound"
msgid "Sound in the mix"
msgstr "混音中的聲音"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:238
msgctxt "@title:column the One Ear Mix fold, in a table beside Plain Mono"
msgid "This mix"
msgstr "此混音"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:316
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Run the session and play something to compare the two"
msgstr "執行工作階段並播放一些聲音，即可比較兩者"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:358
msgctxt "@label the unit of Lower this mix by"
msgid "dB"
msgstr "dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:394
msgctxt "@info why the comparison is not open to use yet"
msgid "Pick an ear first"
msgstr "請先選擇耳朵"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:407
msgctxt "@info what a One Ear Mix cannot do"
msgid ""
"Direction doesn't come back: a mix in one ear can't tell you where a sound "
"is. A sound a quarter of a cycle apart between the sides can get quieter. "
"Peaks can rise by several dB, so keep a limit after this block, as Volume "
"has."
msgstr ""
"方向感無法恢復：單耳中的混音無法告訴您聲音來自哪裡。兩側之間相差四分之一週期的聲音可能會變小聲。峰值可能升高數 "
"dB，因此請在此區塊之後保留一道限制，「音量」區塊就有這種限制。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixPanel.qml:430
msgctxt "@info the figures behind the quarter of a cycle"
msgid ""
"At 1 kHz and a 48 kHz rate, sound where the right side leads the left by a "
"quarter of a cycle comes through 30 dB lower, and sound where it lags comes "
"through 3 dB higher. Plain Mono puts both 3 dB lower."
msgstr ""
"在 1 kHz、取樣率 48 kHz 下，右側比左側超前四分之一週期的聲音會低 30 dB，落後的聲音則會高 3 dB。「一般單聲道」則讓兩者都低 3 "
"dB。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:54
msgctxt "@info what a One Ear Mix choice does"
msgid "Both sides pass as they came. Pick where the sound goes."
msgstr "兩側原樣通過。請選擇聲音要送往哪裡。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:57
msgctxt "@info what a One Ear Mix choice does"
msgid ""
"Puts both sides into the left ear. Sound panned to one side comes through 3 "
"dB lower. The right side is silent."
msgstr "將兩側都放進左耳。偏向一側的聲音會低 3 dB。右側無聲。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:60
msgctxt "@info what a One Ear Mix choice does"
msgid ""
"Puts both sides into the right ear. Sound panned to one side comes through 3 "
"dB lower. The left side is silent."
msgstr "將兩側都放進右耳。偏向一側的聲音會低 3 dB。左側無聲。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:63
msgctxt "@info what a One Ear Mix choice does"
msgid ""
"Puts both sides into one mix, the same on the left and on the right, for one "
"earbud. Sound panned to one side comes through 3 dB lower."
msgstr "將兩側合成一個混音，左右相同，供只戴一邊耳機時使用。偏向一側的聲音會低 3 dB。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:72
msgctxt "@info where a One Ear Mix sends the sound"
msgid "No change. Both sides pass as they came."
msgstr "不變更。兩側原樣通過。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:74
msgctxt "@info where a One Ear Mix sends the sound"
msgid "Left ear. The right side is silent."
msgstr "左耳。右側無聲。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:76
msgctxt "@info where a One Ear Mix sends the sound"
msgid "Right ear. The left side is silent."
msgstr "右耳。左側無聲。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:78
msgctxt "@info where a One Ear Mix sends the sound"
msgid "Both ears. One mix on both sides."
msgstr "雙耳。兩側為同一個混音。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:85
msgctxt "@info a level in decibels, '1.4 dB'"
msgid "%1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:92
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix is fading the right side in"
msgid "Bringing in R"
msgstr "正在加入右側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:94
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix is fading the left side in"
msgid "Bringing in L"
msgstr "正在加入左側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:96
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix is fading both sides in"
msgid "Bringing in both sides"
msgstr "正在加入兩側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:105
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix plays Plain Mono to the left"
msgid "Plain Mono to L"
msgstr "一般單聲道送往左側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:107
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix plays Plain Mono to the right"
msgid "Plain Mono to R"
msgstr "一般單聲道送往右側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:109
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix plays Plain Mono to both sides"
msgid "Plain Mono to both"
msgstr "一般單聲道送往兩側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:119
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix lowered by a number of decibels, to the left"
msgid "One mix −%1 dB to L"
msgstr "單一混音 −%1 dB 送往左側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:121
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix lowered by a number of decibels, to the right"
msgid "One mix −%1 dB to R"
msgstr "單一混音 −%1 dB 送往右側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:123
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix lowered by a number of decibels, to both sides"
msgid "One mix −%1 dB to both"
msgstr "單一混音 −%1 dB 送往兩側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:132
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix that has not been told where to send the sound"
msgid "Pick where it goes"
msgstr "請選擇聲音的去向"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:134
msgctxt "@info both sides as one mix to the left"
msgid "L+R one mix to L"
msgstr "左右合一送往左側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:136
msgctxt "@info both sides as one mix to the right"
msgid "L+R one mix to R"
msgstr "左右合一送往右側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:138
msgctxt "@info both sides as one mix to both sides"
msgid "L+R one mix to both"
msgstr "左右合一送往兩側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:147
msgctxt "@item:intable a kind of sound in a mix"
msgid "Centred"
msgstr "置中"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:148
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in Plain Mono"
msgid "0 dB"
msgstr "0 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:149
#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:159
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in One Ear Mix"
msgid "About 0 dB"
msgstr "約 0 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:152
msgctxt "@item:intable a kind of sound in a mix"
msgid "One side only"
msgstr "僅單側"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:153
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in Plain Mono"
msgid "−6 dB"
msgstr "−6 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:154
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in One Ear Mix"
msgid "−3 dB"
msgstr "−3 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:157
msgctxt "@item:intable a kind of sound in a mix"
msgid "Out of phase"
msgstr "反相"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:158
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in Plain Mono"
msgid "Cancels"
msgstr "抵消"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:162
msgctxt "@item:intable a kind of sound in a mix"
msgid "Unrelated sides"
msgstr "兩側無關"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:163
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in Plain Mono"
msgid "−3 dB"
msgstr "−3 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:164
msgctxt "@item:intable level of a kind of sound in One Ear Mix"
msgid "0 dB"
msgstr "0 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:167
msgctxt "@item:intable peaks of the sound"
msgid "Peaks"
msgstr "峰值"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:168
msgctxt "@item:intable what happens to peaks in Plain Mono"
msgid "No rise"
msgstr "不上升"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:169
msgctxt "@item:intable what happens to peaks in One Ear Mix"
msgid "Can rise"
msgstr "可能上升"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:190
msgctxt ""
"@info:accessibility a cell of a table, 'One side only, Plain Mono: -6 dB'"
msgid "%1, %2: %3"
msgstr "%1，%2：%3"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:199
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix's reading met silence"
msgid "Nothing to measure yet. Play something first."
msgstr "目前沒有可測量的聲音。請先播放一些聲音。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:207
msgctxt ""
"@info a One Ear Mix's reading, nothing changed; %1 is the most it can lower "
"by, '6 dB'"
msgid "The two mixes are more than %1 apart here, so nothing is lowered."
msgstr "兩種混音在此相差超過 %1，因此不做任何調低。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:208
msgctxt "@info a whole number of decibels"
msgid "%1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:214
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix's reading, nothing changed"
msgid "Plain Mono was louder here, so nothing is lowered."
msgstr "此處「一般單聲道」較大聲，因此不做任何調低。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:220
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix's reading, nothing changed"
msgid "The two mixes read the same here, so nothing is lowered."
msgstr "兩種混音在此測得相同，因此不做任何調低。"

#: blocks/oneearmix/ui/OneEarMixWords.qml:227
msgctxt "@info a One Ear Mix's reading; %1 is a level, '1.4 dB'"
msgid ""
"One Ear Mix was %1 louder here, so it is lowered by %1. Set it back to 0 when"
" you are done."
msgstr "此處「單耳混音」大聲了 %1，因此將它調低 %1。完成後請設回 0。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:19
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Plays the sound that reaches it on your speakers, your headphones or another "
"device. It is where a lane is heard."
msgstr "在您的喇叭、耳機或其他裝置上播放送達的聲音。軌道的聲音就是在這裡被聽見的。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Put it at the end of a lane and choose a device. Everything that reaches the "
"block plays there, at the volume you set."
msgstr "將它放在軌道的末端並選擇裝置。送達此區塊的所有聲音都會以您設定的音量在該裝置上播放。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"On a stereo device, the left side of the lane plays on the left and the right"
" on the right. A device with one channel gets both sides mixed together. On a"
" device with more channels, such as surround speakers, the sound plays on the"
" front pair and the others stay silent."
msgstr ""
"在立體聲裝置上，軌道的左側在左邊播放，右側在右邊播放。只有一個聲道的裝置會收到兩側混合後的聲音。在聲道較多的裝置上（例如環繞音響），聲音會在前方的一對喇叭播放，其他喇叭保持無聲。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"If the device is unplugged, the block goes quiet and a warning says so. It "
"plays again by itself when the device comes back."
msgstr "如果裝置被拔除，區塊會變成無聲，並顯示警告。裝置重新接上時，它會自動恢復播放。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Several lanes can end in Output Devices on the same speakers. Their sound is "
"mixed there."
msgstr "多條軌道可以結束於使用同一組喇叭的「輸出裝置」。它們的聲音會在那裡混合。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid "Where the block plays. The list has the devices plugged in now:"
msgstr "區塊播放的位置。清單中列出目前已連接的裝置："

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:43
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block, a choice of Audio device"
msgid ""
"Default output: whatever your desktop plays to. When you change that in the "
"system's settings, or plug in headphones it switches to, the block follows. "
"This is what a new block uses."
msgstr "預設輸出：桌面目前播放到的裝置。當您在系統設定中變更它，或插入耳機讓系統切換過去時，區塊都會跟著改變。新區塊預設使用此項。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:44
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block, a choice of Audio device"
msgid "A device by name: that device, whatever the desktop's choice is."
msgstr "依名稱指定的裝置：不論桌面選擇的是什麼，都使用該裝置。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:45
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block, a choice of Audio device"
msgid ""
"Virtual devices, at the end of the list: microphones with no hardware behind "
"them, such as the ones you make in Reverblabr. Choose one, and other "
"programs, such as a call, can pick the lane up as if it were a microphone."
msgstr ""
"虛擬裝置，位於清單末端：沒有實體硬體的麥克風，例如您在 Reverblabr "
"中建立的虛擬裝置。選擇其中一個後，其他程式（例如通話）就能像使用麥克風一樣接收此軌道。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"A device the block was set to that is not plugged in stays in the list, "
"marked unavailable, so opening the settings never moves the block to another "
"device."
msgstr "區塊已設定但目前未連接的裝置會留在清單中並標示為無法使用，因此開啟設定絕不會讓區塊改用其他裝置。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:54
#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:127
msgctxt "@label:slider how loud the block plays to its device"
msgid "Output volume"
msgstr "輸出音量"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:56
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"How loud the block plays, from 0 %, silence, to 100 %, the sound as it "
"reached the block. A new block starts at 100 %. It can only turn the sound "
"down; to make a lane louder, put a Volume block before it and turn on its "
"Overdrive."
msgstr ""
"區塊播放的音量，從 0 %（無聲）到 100 %（送達區塊時的原始音量）。新區塊預設為 100 "
"%。它只能調低聲音；若要讓軌道更大聲，請在它之前放一個「音量」區塊並開啟其「超量放大」。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"It changes only this block. The device's own volume, and every other program "
"on it, stay as they are. A change glides in over a fiftieth of a second, so "
"moving the slider never makes a click."
msgstr "它只會改變此區塊。裝置本身的音量和使用該裝置的其他程式都維持不變。變更會在五十分之一秒內平滑過渡，因此移動滑桿絕不會產生喀噠聲。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:63
#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:197
msgctxt "@label the highest level this block sends to the output"
msgid "Last limit"
msgstr "最終限制"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:67
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Last limit: the highest level this block sends to the output, in dBFS. It "
"appears only when a session needs it."
msgstr "最終限制：此區塊送到輸出的最高準位，單位為 dBFS。只有在工作階段需要時才會出現。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"On a chain with a Hearing block, the last thing the sound meets is a limit. "
"If a block that can add gain comes after the last limit, this block adds a "
"limit of its own and says which block caused it. It adds about 2 ms of delay."
" The limit keeps to the lowest Output ceiling on the way here."
msgstr ""
"在含有聽力類區塊的處理鏈中，聲音最後遇到的是一道限制。如果在最後一道限制之後還有可能增加增益的區塊，此區塊會加上自己的限制，並說明是哪個區塊造成的。這會增加約"
" 2 ms 的延遲。此限制會遵守沿途最低的「輸出上限」。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:69
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"It is a digital limit: it works on numbers inside the computer. How loud that"
" is at your ear depends on your volume, your sound card and your headphones, "
"which Reverblabr can't know."
msgstr "這是數位限制：它作用於電腦內部的數值。實際傳到耳朵的音量取決於您的音量設定、音效卡和耳機，而這些是 Reverblabr 無從得知的。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:70
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Lowering it works at once. Raising it takes one more step, with Raise…, and "
"the sound rises slowly to the new limit."
msgstr "調低會立即生效。調高則需要多一個步驟，即按「提高…」，聲音會緩慢上升到新的限制。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:77
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Click the heading to choose which of the device's channels the left and the "
"right side play on. Most devices never need it."
msgstr "按一下標題即可選擇左右兩側要在裝置的哪個聲道播放。大多數裝置都不需要這麼做。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:86
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Which of the device's channels the left side and the right side of the lane "
"play on. The lists show the channels by the names the device gives them, such"
" as FL and FR for front left and front right, or AUX0, AUX1 and so on."
msgstr "軌道的左側和右側分別在裝置的哪個聲道播放。清單會以裝置提供的名稱顯示聲道，例如代表左前和右前的 FL 和 FR，或 AUX0、AUX1 等。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:87
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Default, what a new block uses, leaves it to the block, as described above. A"
" channel you choose gets that side whole, and nothing else: outputs 3 and 4 "
"of an audio interface for a second pair of speakers, for example."
msgstr ""
"「預設」（新區塊預設使用）會依上述方式交由區塊決定。您選擇的聲道會完整取得該側的聲音，且只有該側：例如將音訊介面的第 3 和第 4 輸出用於第二組喇叭。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:88
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"Once you choose a channel for one side, the other side is not heard until you"
" choose one for it too."
msgstr "為其中一側選擇聲道後，另一側在您也為它選擇聲道之前都不會發出聲音。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:95
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"You want to hear what a lane does, on your speakers or in your headphones."
msgstr "您想用喇叭或耳機聽聽軌道處理後的效果。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:96
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"You want a call or another program to hear the lane as a microphone: choose a"
" virtual device."
msgstr "您想讓通話或其他程式把此軌道當作麥克風來接收：請選擇虛擬裝置。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:97
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"You want one lane on the speakers and another in the headphones, each at its "
"own volume."
msgstr "您想讓一條軌道在喇叭播放、另一條在耳機播放，各自有自己的音量。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:104
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"When the session records from a virtual device, choose your real speakers "
"here by name. Left on Default output, the block could follow the default to "
"the very device the session records from; Reverblabr refuses that connection,"
" because the sound would go round in a loop."
msgstr ""
"當工作階段從虛擬裝置錄音時，請在這裡依名稱選擇您真正的喇叭。如果維持「預設輸出」，區塊可能會跟隨預設值，正好連到工作階段錄音的那個裝置；Reverblabr"
" 會拒絕這種連線，因為聲音會形成迴圈。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:105
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid ""
"If you hear a program twice, it is playing to the speakers itself as well as "
"through the lane. Move the program to another device in the system's sound "
"settings, or end the lane somewhere else."
msgstr ""
"如果您聽到某個程式的聲音出現兩次，表示它除了經由軌道之外，也直接播放到喇叭。請在系統的音效設定中將該程式移到其他裝置，或讓軌道結束於其他地方。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDeviceHelp.qml:106
msgctxt "@info help page of the Output Device block"
msgid "To check a speaker or a cable, wire a Wave block to an Output Device."
msgstr "若要檢查喇叭或線材，請將「音波」區塊連接到「輸出裝置」。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:69
msgctxt "@info why this block has a limit; the name of a block"
msgid ""
"This limit is here because %1 can add gain after the last limit. It adds "
"about 2 ms of delay."
msgstr "加上此限制是因為 %1 可能在最後一道限制之後增加增益。這會增加約 2 ms 的延遲。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:73
msgctxt "@info why this block has a limit"
msgid ""
"This limit is here because two wires meet at one input, and their sum can go "
"past the last limit. It adds about 2 ms of delay."
msgstr "加上此限制是因為有兩條連線匯入同一個輸入，相加後可能超過最後一道限制。這會增加約 2 ms 的延遲。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:76
msgctxt "@info why this block has a limit"
msgid ""
"This limit is here because both sides go to one channel, where together they "
"can pass the last limit. It adds about 2 ms of delay."
msgstr "加上此限制是因為兩側都送到同一個聲道，合在一起時可能超過最後一道限制。這會增加約 2 ms 的延遲。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:106
msgctxt "@info the chosen output is not plugged in"
msgid ""
"This output is not there at the moment. It comes back on its own when the "
"device does."
msgstr "此輸出目前不存在。裝置恢復時它也會自動恢復。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:136
msgctxt "@info:status a volume, as a percentage"
msgid "%1 %"
msgstr "%1 %"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:154
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Output volume"
msgstr "輸出音量"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:200
msgctxt "@info said at the end of a slider"
msgid "Last limit stops here. To raise it, use Raise."
msgstr "最終限制停在這裡。若要提高，請使用「提高」。"

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:201
msgctxt "@info the question over a number"
msgid "Last limit is %1 dBFS. Raise it to:"
msgstr "最終限制為 %1 dBFS。提高到："

#: blocks/outputdevice/ui/OutputDevicePanel.qml:214
msgctxt "@info a lower limit further up the chain is the one that holds"
msgid "Set lower by Output ceiling: %1 dBFS"
msgstr "已由「輸出上限」設得更低：%1 dBFS"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"Puts a sound at one place between the left and the right speaker, at the same"
" loudness wherever it sits."
msgstr "將聲音放在左右喇叭之間的某個位置，無論放在哪裡響度都相同。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"The block first makes one sound of the two sides, by averaging them. A sound "
"that was in the middle keeps its level; a stereo recording loses its own "
"spread of left and right."
msgstr "區塊會先將兩側平均，合成一個聲音。原本位於中間的聲音會保持其準位；立體聲錄音則會失去原本左右的分布。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"It then sends that one sound to the two speakers in the proportion you set. "
"In the middle both carry it equally; all the way to one side, only that "
"speaker plays it."
msgstr "接著它會依您設定的比例，將這個聲音送到兩個喇叭。位於中間時兩個喇叭平均分擔；完全偏向一側時，只有那一側的喇叭播放。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"The sound keeps the same loudness wherever you put it: in the middle each "
"side plays it a little quieter, so the two together are as loud as one side "
"alone at the end."
msgstr "無論放在哪裡，聲音的響度都維持不變：位於中間時每一側播放得稍微小聲一點，因此兩側加起來的響度與偏到盡頭時單側的響度相同。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"A change glides in over a fiftieth of a second, so dragging the slider while "
"the sound plays makes no click. The sound is not delayed."
msgstr "變更會在五十分之一秒內平滑過渡，因此在聲音播放時拖曳滑桿也不會產生喀噠聲。聲音不會延遲。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:35 blocks/pan/ui/PanUi.qml:23
#: blocks/pan/ui/PanUi.qml:29
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Pan"
msgstr "聲像"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:37
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"Where the sound sits. L under the left end of the slider is the left side, R "
"under the right end is the right."
msgstr "聲音所在的位置。滑桿左端下方的「左」代表左側，右端下方的「右」代表右側。"

#. i18n: keep the examples as the panel writes them: Centre, L 30, R 100.
#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"The number above the slider says where it is: Centre in the middle, then L or"
" R and how far, up to 100 at either end. L 30 is a little to the left; R 100 "
"is the right speaker alone."
msgstr ""
"滑桿上方的數字會顯示目前的位置：位於中間時顯示「置中」，否則顯示「左」或「右」以及偏移的程度，兩端最多為 100。「左 30」表示稍微偏左；「右 "
"100」表示只有右喇叭發聲。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid "A new block starts at Centre."
msgstr "新區塊預設為「置中」。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:47
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"Two people talk in the same recording or call, and you want one on each side "
"so they are easier to tell apart."
msgstr "同一段錄音或通話中有兩個人在說話，而您想讓他們各在一側，以便更容易分辨。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:48
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"A mono source, such as a microphone, should sound as if it comes from one "
"side."
msgstr "單聲道來源（例如麥克風）應該聽起來像是從某一側傳來的。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"Several sources play at once, and spreading them out keeps them from crowding"
" each other."
msgstr "多個來源同時播放，將它們分散開來可以避免彼此擁擠。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:56
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"To make one side of a stereo recording quieter and keep its stereo, use the "
"Balance block instead. Pan always makes one sound of the two sides first."
msgstr "若要讓立體聲錄音的其中一側變小聲並保留其立體聲，請改用「平衡」區塊。「聲像」一律會先將兩側合成一個聲音。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"Small moves go a long way. Try L 30 or R 30 before going all the way to one "
"end."
msgstr "小小的調整就有明顯效果。在一路調到盡頭之前，先試試「左 30」或「右 30」。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pan block"
msgid ""
"A Peak/RMS meter after the block shows the left and the right side apart, so "
"you can see where the sound went."
msgstr "在區塊之後放一個「峰值/RMS」儀表，可以分別顯示左右兩側，讓您看到聲音去了哪裡。"

#: blocks/pan/ui/PanUi.qml:22
msgctxt "@label what the setting on a Pan tile is"
msgid "pan"
msgstr "聲像"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqFace.qml:42
msgctxt "@info:tooltip one band of an equaliser, 'Bell 250 Hz +9.0 dB'"
msgid "%1 %2 %3"
msgstr "%1 %2 %3"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqFace.qml:44
msgctxt "@info:tooltip one band of an equaliser with no gain, 'Notch 60 Hz'"
msgid "%1 %2"
msgstr "%1 %2"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqFace.qml:47
msgctxt "@info:tooltip an equaliser with no band switched on"
msgid "No bands"
msgstr "沒有頻段"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:18
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Shapes the tone of the sound with up to ten bands that you place yourself, "
"each lifting, cutting or filtering the sound around a frequency you choose."
msgstr "以最多十個由您自行放置的頻段調整聲音的音色，每個頻段都會在您選擇的頻率附近提升、衰減或濾除聲音。"

#. i18n: Hz stands for hertz, kHz for kilohertz.
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Every sound is a mix of low and high pitches. Their frequency is counted in "
"hertz (Hz), vibrations a second: a deep bass is around 50 Hz, a voice mostly "
"between 100 Hz and 4000 Hz, and the hiss of a cymbal near 10 000 Hz, or 10 "
"kHz. An equaliser, EQ for short, makes some of those frequencies louder or "
"quieter."
msgstr ""
"每種聲音都是高低音高的混合。它們的頻率以赫茲（Hz）計算，也就是每秒振動的次數：低沉的貝斯約在 50 Hz，人聲大多介於 100 Hz 到 4000 Hz"
" 之間，鈸的嘶聲則接近 10,000 Hz，也就是 10 kHz。等化器（簡稱 EQ）會讓其中某些頻率變大聲或變小聲。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Each band works on one part of that range. You choose where it is, how wide "
"it is, and how much it lifts or cuts. The curve at the top shows what all the"
" bands do together: up is louder, down is quieter, from 20 Hz at the left to "
"20 kHz at the right."
msgstr ""
"每個頻段作用於這個範圍的一部分。您可以選擇它的位置、寬度，以及提升或衰減的程度。頂端的曲線顯示所有頻段合起來的效果：往上是較大聲，往下是較小聲，從左邊的 "
"20 Hz 到右邊的 20 kHz。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Each band has a round handle on the curve. Drag it sideways to move the "
"band's frequency, and up or down to change its gain. Turn the mouse wheel "
"over a handle to make the band narrower or wider."
msgstr "每個頻段在曲線上都有一個圓形控點。左右拖曳可移動頻段的頻率，上下拖曳可變更其增益。在控點上轉動滑鼠滾輪，可讓頻段變窄或變寬。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"While the session runs, the sound leaving the block is drawn faintly behind "
"the curve, so you can see where its low and high parts are."
msgstr "工作階段執行時，離開此區塊的聲音會淡淡地畫在曲線後方，讓您看出它的低音和高音部分在哪裡。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:28
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"A new block has three bands, at 100 Hz, 1 kHz and 8 kHz, all at 0 dB, so it "
"changes nothing until you move one. Every change glides in, and a band that "
"is added, removed or changed in type fades, so nothing clicks. The block adds"
" no delay."
msgstr ""
"新區塊有三個頻段，分別位於 100 Hz、1 kHz 和 8 kHz，全都是 0 "
"dB，因此在您移動其中一個之前不會改變任何東西。每項變更都會平順地過渡；新增、移除或變更類型的頻段會淡入淡出，因此不會有喀噠聲。此區塊不會增加延遲。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:38
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:437
msgctxt "@title:group the Parametric EQ's bands, one to pick"
msgid "Bands"
msgstr "頻段"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"A button for each band, named by its frequency, from low to high. Click one "
"to pick that band; the settings below are the picked band's. Clicking or "
"dragging a handle on the curve picks its band too. A band that is switched "
"off is drawn faded."
msgstr ""
"每個頻段各有一個按鈕，以其頻率命名，由低到高排列。按一下即可選取該頻段；下方的設定就是所選頻段的設定。按一下或拖曳曲線上的控點，也會選取其頻段。已關閉的頻段會以淡色顯示。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:46
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:471
msgctxt "@action:button add a band to a Parametric EQ"
msgid "Add Band"
msgstr "新增頻段"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:48
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:484
msgctxt "@action:button remove the selected band from a Parametric EQ"
msgid "Delete Band"
msgstr "刪除頻段"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:51
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Add Band adds a bell at 0 dB in the middle of the widest stretch of the curve"
" with no band in it, and picks it. There can be ten bands at most."
msgstr "「新增頻段」會在曲線上沒有頻段的最寬區段中央，新增一個 0 dB 的鐘形頻段並選取它。最多可有十個頻段。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:52
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid "Delete Band removes the picked band."
msgstr "「刪除頻段」會移除所選的頻段。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:58
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:509
msgctxt "@label:listbox the type of a Parametric EQ band"
msgid "Type"
msgstr "類型"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:60
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid "What the band does to the sound around its frequency:"
msgstr "頻段對其頻率附近聲音的作用："

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:63
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"Bell: lifts or cuts a range of frequencies around the band's frequency, as "
"much as its gain says. What a new band is."
msgstr "「鐘形」：依其增益，提升或衰減頻段頻率附近的一段頻率範圍。新頻段即為此類型。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:64
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"Low shelf: lifts or cuts everything below the frequency, for more or less "
"bass."
msgstr "「低頻架式」：提升或衰減該頻率以下的所有聲音，讓低音更多或更少。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:65
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"High shelf: lifts or cuts everything above the frequency, for more or less "
"treble."
msgstr "「高頻架式」：提升或衰減該頻率以上的所有聲音，讓高音更多或更少。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"Low-pass: keeps what is below the frequency and takes away more and more of "
"what is above it."
msgstr "「低通」：保留該頻率以下的聲音，越高於該頻率的聲音濾除得越多。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:67
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"High-pass: keeps what is above the frequency and takes away more and more of "
"what is below it, such as rumble."
msgstr "「高通」：保留該頻率以上的聲音，越低於該頻率的聲音濾除得越多，例如隆隆聲。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"Notch: takes out a narrow range around the frequency almost completely, such "
"as a whistle."
msgstr "「陷波」：幾乎完全去除該頻率附近的一小段範圍，例如哨音。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:69
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block, a type of band"
msgid ""
"Band-pass: keeps only a range around the frequency, as a telephone does."
msgstr "「帶通」：只保留該頻率附近的一段範圍，就像電話一樣。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:72
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Only a bell and the shelves have a gain. The others leave Gain unavailable, "
"and their handle stays on the 0 dB line."
msgstr "只有鐘形和架式頻段有增益。其他類型無法使用「增益」，它們的控點會停留在 0 dB 線上。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:78
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:533
msgctxt "@option:check a Parametric EQ band is switched on"
msgid "Band on"
msgstr "啟用頻段"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:80
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"The switch beside Type turns the picked band off and on again, keeping its "
"settings. Use it to hear the sound with and without the band."
msgstr "「類型」旁的開關可關閉或重新開啟所選的頻段，並保留其設定。可用來比較有無該頻段時的聲音。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:86
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:549
msgctxt "@label:slider a Parametric EQ band's frequency"
msgid "Frequency"
msgstr "頻率"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:88
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Where the band is, from 20 Hz to 20 kHz. The slider moves by octaves rather "
"than by hertz, as the ear hears pitch, so the low end has as much room as the"
" high."
msgstr "頻段的位置，範圍從 20 Hz 到 20 kHz。滑桿以八度而非赫茲移動，與耳朵感知音高的方式一致，因此低頻端和高頻端有同樣大的空間。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:94
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:586
msgctxt "@label:slider a Parametric EQ band's gain"
msgid "Gain"
msgstr "增益"

#. i18n: dB stands for decibels.
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:97
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"How much a bell or a shelf lifts or cuts, in decibels (dB), from −18 dB to "
"+18 dB. 0 dB changes nothing, +6 dB is about twice the strength and −6 dB "
"about half."
msgstr ""
"鐘形或架式頻段提升或衰減的程度，單位為分貝（dB），範圍從 −18 dB 到 +18 dB。0 dB 不做任何改變，+6 dB 約為兩倍強度，−6 dB "
"約為一半。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:103
#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:621
msgctxt "@label:slider how narrow a Parametric EQ band is"
msgid "Q"
msgstr "Q"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:105
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"How narrow the band is, from 0.1 to 18. A new band has 1. Higher is narrower:"
" a high Q picks out a single note or a whistle, a low Q changes a broad part "
"of the sound gently."
msgstr "頻段的窄度，範圍從 0.1 到 18。新頻段為 1。數值越高越窄：高 Q 值可挑出單一音符或哨音，低 Q 值則平緩地改變聲音中較寬的一部分。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:106
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"For the shelves and the pass filters it shapes the bend where they start: "
"around 0.7 is smooth, and higher adds a small bump just before it."
msgstr "對架式頻段和通過型濾波器來說，它決定起始處轉折的形狀：約 0.7 時平滑，數值更高則會在轉折前多出一個小突起。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:113
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"A voice sounds muddy, boomy or harsh, and you want to fix just that part."
msgstr "人聲聽起來混濁、轟鳴或刺耳，您只想修正那一部分。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:114
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid "A steady whistle or ring needs taking out without dulling the rest."
msgstr "需要去除持續的哨音或鳴響，又不想讓其他聲音變得沉悶。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:115
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid "The bass rumbles from handling the microphone, or traffic outside."
msgstr "低音中有拿動麥克風或外頭車流造成的隆隆聲。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:116
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Your speakers or headphones have too much or too little of something, and you"
" want to even them out."
msgstr "您的喇叭或耳機某些聲音太多或太少，您想讓它們平衡一些。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:123
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"To find a problem, raise a narrow bell by 10 dB or so and sweep it slowly "
"left and right. Where the problem gets loudest, stop, then pull the gain down"
" below 0 dB."
msgstr "要找出問題所在，可將一個窄的鐘形頻段提升約 10 dB，然後慢慢左右掃動。在問題最明顯的地方停下，再把增益拉到 0 dB 以下。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:124
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Cut more than you lift. Taking away what is wrong usually sounds better than "
"adding more of everything else, and keeps the sound from getting too loud."
msgstr "多衰減、少提升。去除有問題的部分，通常比增加其他所有部分聽起來更好，也能避免聲音變得太大聲。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:125
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"A high-pass around 80 Hz clears rumble from most voices without changing how "
"they sound."
msgstr "約 80 Hz 的高通可去除大多數人聲中的隆隆聲，而不會改變人聲的聽感。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqHelp.qml:126
msgctxt "@info help page of the Parametric EQ block"
msgid ""
"Switch a band off and on again with Band on to check that it still helps."
msgstr "用「啟用頻段」關閉再重新開啟頻段，確認它仍有幫助。"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:372
msgctxt "@info a Parametric EQ band's handle, 'Bell at 250 Hz'"
msgid "%1 at %2"
msgstr "%1 %2"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:456
msgctxt "@action:button pick a Parametric EQ band, 'Bell at 250 Hz'"
msgid "%1 at %2"
msgstr "%1 %2"

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:498
msgctxt "@label:listbox the type of a Parametric EQ band"
msgid "Type:"
msgstr "類型："

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:539
msgctxt "@label:slider a Parametric EQ band's frequency"
msgid "Frequency:"
msgstr "頻率："

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:574
msgctxt "@label:slider a Parametric EQ band's gain"
msgid "Gain:"
msgstr "增益："

#: blocks/parametriceq/ui/ParametricEqPanel.qml:610
msgctxt "@label:slider how narrow a Parametric EQ band is"
msgid "Q:"
msgstr "Q："

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsFace.qml:59
msgctxt "@info the loudest side, in decibels below full scale"
msgid "%1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsFace.qml:61 blocks/vumeter/ui/VuFace.qml:46
msgctxt "@info nothing is running"
msgid "Idle"
msgstr "閒置"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"Shows how loud the sound is at this point of a lane, for the left side and "
"the right. It only measures: the sound passes through unchanged."
msgstr "顯示軌道中此位置左右兩側的聲音大小。它只負責測量：聲音會原樣通過。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"Each side has a bar that moves with the sound while the session runs. Two "
"things are measured at once."
msgstr "工作階段執行時，每一側都有一個隨聲音移動的長條。同時測量兩種數值。"

#. i18n: RMS stays in Latin letters in most languages; the paragraph explains
#. it.
#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"The solid part of the bar is the RMS level: the average strength of the sound"
" over the last three tenths of a second. RMS is short for root mean square, a"
" way of averaging that follows how loud the sound feels."
msgstr "長條的實心部分是 RMS 準位：最近十分之三秒內聲音的平均強度。RMS 是「均方根」的縮寫，這種求平均的方法能反映聲音聽起來的大小。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"The paler part above it reaches up to the peak: the loudest single moment. "
"Peaks show sudden sounds, such as a drum hit or a plosive, that the average "
"hides."
msgstr "上方顏色較淺的部分會延伸到峰值：也就是最大聲的單一瞬間。峰值能顯示被平均值掩蓋的突發聲音，例如鼓擊聲或爆破音。"

#. i18n: dB stands for decibels.
#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:27
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"The scale between the bars is in decibels (dB), from 0 at the top down to "
"−60. 0 dB is full scale, the loudest a digital signal can be. Every 6 dB "
"lower is about half the signal's strength."
msgstr ""
"長條之間的刻度以分貝（dB）為單位，從頂端的 0 往下到 −60。0 dB 是滿刻度，也就是數位訊號所能達到的最大音量。每降低 6 dB，訊號強度約減半。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:28
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid "The top 6 dB of each bar are red. Sound up there is close to the limit."
msgstr "每個長條最上方的 6 dB 為紅色。到達那裡的聲音已接近極限。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:29
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"A thin line marks the highest recent peak. It waits there for as long as Hold"
" peaks says, then sinks back at 20 dB a second."
msgstr "一條細線標示最近的最高峰值。它會依「峰值保持」的設定停留在那裡，然後以每秒 20 dB 的速度下降。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:30
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"The box above each side lights when that side reaches full scale. The sound "
"has probably been clipped there: the tops of its waves were cut off, which "
"you may hear as a crackle. The light stays on for a second and a half after "
"the last time, so you do not miss it; click it to put it out sooner."
msgstr ""
"當某一側達到滿刻度時，該側上方的方框會亮起。聲音可能已在該處削波：波形的頂端被切掉，您可能會聽到劈啪聲。最後一次亮起後，燈會持續亮一秒半，讓您不會錯過；按一下即可提早熄滅。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:31
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"Point at a bar to read its held peak and its RMS as numbers, to a tenth of a "
"decibel."
msgstr "將指標移到長條上，即可讀取其保持的峰值和 RMS 數值，精確到十分之一分貝。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:41
#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:221
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Show peak bar"
msgstr "顯示峰值長條"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:43
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"Draws the paler part of each bar, the one that jumps up to every peak. Untick"
" it if that jumping distracts you: the bars then show the RMS level alone, "
"here, on the block's tile and in the system tray."
msgstr ""
"繪製每個長條中顏色較淺、會跳到每個峰值的部分。如果跳動讓您分心，請取消勾選：長條就只會顯示 RMS 準位，在這裡、區塊的圖塊上和系統匣中都是如此。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:44
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"The peak line, the clip boxes and the numbers stay. A new block shows the "
"peak bar."
msgstr "峰值線、削波方框和數值則會保留。新區塊會顯示峰值長條。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:50
#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:240
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowHelp.qml:76
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:303
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugeHelp.qml:99
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:427 blocks/vumeter/ui/VuHelp.qml:60
#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:205
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Show in system tray"
msgstr "顯示在系統匣中"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:52
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"Adds this meter to what you see when you click Reverblabr's icon in the "
"system tray. You can then keep an eye on the level with the main window "
"closed."
msgstr "在您按一下系統匣中的 Reverblabr 圖示時所看到的內容中加入此儀表。這樣即使關閉主視窗，也能隨時留意準位。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:53
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid "It is off for a new block."
msgstr "新區塊預設為關閉。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:59
#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:262
#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:279
msgctxt "@label:listbox how long the peak line waits before falling"
msgid "Hold peaks"
msgstr "峰值保持"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:61
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"How long the peak line waits at the loudest moment before it sinks. Click the"
" value to choose another."
msgstr "峰值線在最大聲的瞬間停留多久才下降。按一下數值即可選擇其他設定。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:64
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block, one choice of Hold peaks"
msgid "Off: the line does not wait, and starts sinking at once."
msgstr "關閉：線條不會停留，會立即開始下降。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:65
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block, the choices of Hold peaks"
msgid ""
"1 second, 2 seconds or 5 seconds: the line waits that long. A new block waits"
" 2 seconds."
msgstr "1 秒、2 秒或 5 秒：線條會停留這麼久。新區塊會停留 2 秒。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block, one choice of Hold peaks"
msgid ""
"Until reset: the line stays at the loudest moment and never sinks. Choose "
"another setting to let it sink again."
msgstr "直到重設：線條會停在最大聲的瞬間，永不下降。選擇其他設定即可讓它再次下降。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:73
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid "To check that a source is reaching Reverblabr at all."
msgstr "檢查來源是否真的傳到了 Reverblabr。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:74
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"To set a level before recording or streaming, so that it is loud enough and "
"never clips."
msgstr "在錄音或串流前設定準位，讓聲音夠大聲又不會削波。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:75
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid "To see what a block changes: put one meter before it and one after it."
msgstr "查看某個區塊改變了什麼：在它之前和之後各放一個儀表。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:82
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid "For speech, aim for peaks that mostly stay out of the red."
msgstr "處理說話聲時，目標是讓峰值大多不進入紅色區域。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:83
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"Choose Until reset while you set a level, play the loudest part, and read "
"where the line stopped."
msgstr "設定準位時請選擇「直到重設」，播放最大聲的部分，再讀取線條停下的位置。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsHelp.qml:84
msgctxt "@info help page of the Peak/RMS block"
msgid ""
"If a clip box keeps lighting, turn down whatever comes before the meter until"
" it stays dark."
msgstr "如果削波方框一直亮起，請調低儀表之前的聲音，直到方框不再亮起。"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:107
msgctxt ""
"@info:tooltip one side's held peak and its root mean square, 'Peak −12.0 dB, "
"RMS −15.0 dB'"
msgid "Peak %1, RMS %2"
msgstr "峰值 %1，RMS %2"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:114
msgctxt "@item the peak line does not wait at all, short"
msgid "Off"
msgstr "關閉"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:116
msgctxt "@item how long the peak line waits, short"
msgid "1 s"
msgstr "1 秒"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:118
msgctxt "@item how long the peak line waits, short"
msgid "2 s"
msgstr "2 秒"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:120
msgctxt "@item how long the peak line waits, short"
msgid "5 s"
msgstr "5 秒"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:122
msgctxt "@item the peak line never comes down, short"
msgid "Until reset"
msgstr "直到重設"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:139
msgctxt "@info a level too quiet to put a number on"
msgid "—"
msgstr "—"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:141 blocks/wave/ui/WaveWords.qml:74
msgctxt "@info a level in decibels below full scale"
msgid "%1 dB"
msgstr "%1 dB"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:193
#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:116
msgctxt "@info the left channel's meter"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "左聲道"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:194
#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:117
msgctxt "@info the right channel's meter"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "右聲道"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:224
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Draws the paler bar that jumps up to each peak above the RMS bar"
msgstr "在 RMS 長條上方繪製會跳到每個峰值的淺色長條"

#: blocks/peakrmsmeter/ui/PeakRmsPanel.qml:245
#: blocks/speechnow/ui/SpeechNowPanel.qml:305
#: blocks/voicegauge/ui/VoiceGaugePanel.qml:429
#: blocks/vumeter/ui/VuPanel.qml:209
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Shows this meter when you click Reverblabr's icon in the system tray"
msgstr "按一下系統匣中的 Reverblabr 圖示時顯示此儀表"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftFace.qml:82
msgctxt "@label what the number on a Pitch Shift tile is"
msgid "pitch"
msgstr "音高"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftFace.qml:101
msgctxt "@label:slider how far the pitch is moved, in semitones"
msgid "Semitones"
msgstr "半音"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:18
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid "Makes a sound higher or lower without making it faster or slower."
msgstr "讓聲音變高或變低，但不會讓它變快或變慢。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"Played faster, a recording gets higher; played slower, it gets lower. This "
"block changes only the pitch: words and music keep their speed."
msgstr "錄音播放得越快，聲音就越高；播放得越慢，聲音就越低。此區塊只改變音高：說話和音樂都會保持原本的速度。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"It cuts the sound into short overlapping pieces, a few hundredths of a second"
" each, and fits them back together at the new pitch. It is set up for speech."
" Small shifts sound the most natural; the further you move the pitch, the "
"more the joins can be heard."
msgstr ""
"它會把聲音切成彼此重疊的短片段，每段百分之幾秒，再以新的音高重新拼接起來。它是針對說話聲調整的。小幅度的偏移聽起來最自然；音高移動得越多，接縫就越容易被聽出來。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"To do that work, it holds the sound back by about six hundredths of a second,"
" whatever the setting."
msgstr "為了完成這項工作，無論設定為何，它都會讓聲音延遲約百分之六秒。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:26
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"A new setting is heard a moment later: the block starts the new pitch beside "
"the old one and crosses over smoothly, so a change never clicks."
msgstr "新的設定會在片刻之後才聽得到：區塊會在舊音高旁開始新的音高，並平順地交叉轉換，因此變更時絕不會發出喀噠聲。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:36
#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:50
msgctxt "@label:slider how far the pitch is moved, in whole semitones"
msgid "Semitones"
msgstr "半音"

#. i18n: st stands for semitones, as the panel writes it.
#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:39
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"Moves the pitch in whole steps. A semitone is the step from one key of a "
"piano to the next, white or black; twelve of them make an octave. The number "
"is written in st, for semitones."
msgstr "以整數步進移動音高。一個半音是鋼琴上從一個琴鍵到相鄰琴鍵（無論黑鍵或白鍵）的距離；十二個半音構成一個八度。數值以「半音」為單位。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:40
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"The slider goes from −12, an octave down, to +12, an octave up. A new block "
"starts at 0, which leaves the pitch alone."
msgstr "滑桿範圍從 −12（低一個八度）到 +12（高一個八度）。新區塊的起始值為 0，也就是不改變音高。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:46
#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:113
msgctxt "@label:slider fine tuning of the pitch, in hundredths of a semitone"
msgid "Cents"
msgstr "音分"

#. i18n: ct stands for cents, as the panel writes it.
#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:49
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"Fine tuning on top of the semitones. A cent is a hundredth of a semitone, "
"written ct. The slider goes from −100 to +100 in whole cents, and starts at "
"0."
msgstr "在半音之上再做微調。一音分是半音的百分之一，以「音分」標示。滑桿範圍從 −100 到 +100，以整數音分調整，起始值為 0。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:50
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"The line under the sliders adds the two up: with +3 semitones and +25 cents "
"it says the sound is moved by +3.25 st in all."
msgstr "滑桿下方的那一行會將兩者相加：例如 +3 半音加上 +25 音分，會顯示聲音總共移動了 +3.25 半音。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:57
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"A recording was made on a machine that ran slightly fast or slow, and is out "
"of tune with everything else."
msgstr "錄音是用轉速稍快或稍慢的機器錄製的，與其他所有聲音的音調都對不上。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"You want to sing or play along with a song in a key that suits you better."
msgstr "您想用更適合自己的調性，跟著歌曲一起唱或演奏。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:59
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"You want a voice to sound different, deeper or brighter, for fun or to make "
"it harder to recognise."
msgstr "您想讓人聲聽起來不一樣（更低沉或更明亮），好玩或讓人更難認出。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:66
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"For a voice, a few semitones either way already change it a lot. Try small "
"steps first."
msgstr "對人聲來說，往上或往下移動幾個半音就已經改變很多。請先從小幅度開始嘗試。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:67
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"To tune one recording to another, set Semitones first, then move Cents slowly"
" until the two sound in tune together."
msgstr "若要讓一個錄音與另一個的音調一致，請先設定「半音」，再慢慢移動「音分」，直到兩者聽起來音準一致。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Pitch Shift block"
msgid ""
"Because the sound comes out a little late, do not use the block on your own "
"voice while you listen to yourself live: the delay is easy to notice."
msgstr "由於聲音輸出時會稍有延遲，請勿在即時監聽自己的聲音時對自己的人聲使用此區塊：延遲很容易察覺。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:74
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Semitones"
msgstr "半音"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:95
msgctxt "@label the low end of the Pitch Shift's semitones"
msgid "An octave down"
msgstr "低八度"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:102
msgctxt "@label the high end of the Pitch Shift's semitones"
msgid "An octave up"
msgstr "高八度"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:137
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Cents"
msgstr "音分"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:156
msgctxt "@info the whole shift of a Pitch Shift, '+3.25 st'"
msgid "Moved by %1 in all"
msgstr "總共移動 %1"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftPanel.qml:164
msgctxt "@info what the Pitch Shift block does"
msgid ""
"Moves the pitch up or down without the sound running faster or slower. A "
"semitone is one step on a piano; twelve are an octave. The sound comes out a "
"little late, and a change of pitch takes a moment to cross over."
msgstr "升高或降低音高，聲音不會因此變快或變慢。一個半音是鋼琴上的一步；十二個半音為一個八度。聲音輸出時會稍有延遲，變更音高也需要片刻才能轉換完成。"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftWords.qml:22
msgctxt "@label a shift upwards, as in +3"
msgid "+%1"
msgstr "+%1"

#: blocks/pitchshift/ui/PitchShiftWords.qml:23
msgctxt "@label a shift downwards, as in −3"
msgid "−%1"
msgstr "−%1"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginFace.qml:38
msgctxt "@label a plugin block with no plugin chosen yet"
msgid "Choose a plugin"
msgstr "選擇外掛程式"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:65
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "This plugin has no window that can be shown here"
msgstr "此外掛程式沒有可在這裡顯示的視窗"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:67
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The plugin couldn't make its window"
msgstr "外掛程式無法建立它的視窗"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:69
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "The plugin's window closed when the plugin stopped"
msgstr "外掛程式停止時，它的視窗已關閉"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:167
msgctxt "@action:button start a plugin that crashed again"
msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重新啟動"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:181
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox no plugin has been chosen for a plugin block"
msgid "Choose a plugin…"
msgstr "選擇外掛程式…"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:183
msgctxt "@label:listbox which plugin a plugin block runs"
msgid "Plugin"
msgstr "外掛程式"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:203
msgctxt "@action:button show the plugin's own window"
msgid "Plugin Window"
msgstr "外掛程式視窗"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:204
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Shows the plugin's own controls in a window of their own"
msgstr "在獨立的視窗中顯示外掛程式本身的控制項"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:232
msgctxt "@label the presets that come with a plugin, or were saved for it"
msgid "Plugin presets:"
msgstr "外掛程式預設集："

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:244
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox the plugin's settings match none of its presets"
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手動"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:249
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Plugin preset"
msgstr "外掛程式預設集"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:266
msgctxt "@action:button keep the plugin's settings as one of its own presets"
msgid "Save…"
msgstr "儲存…"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:277
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "Save Plugin Preset"
msgstr "儲存外掛程式預設集"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:300
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Saved as the plugin's own preset, which other programs that use this plugin "
"can open too."
msgstr "儲存為外掛程式本身的預設集，其他使用此外掛程式的程式也能開啟。"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:317
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Mono plugin on a stereo lane"
msgstr "立體聲軌道上的單聲道外掛程式"

#: blocks/pluginblock/ui/PluginPanel.qml:351
msgctxt ""
"@info:placeholder a plugin whose settings are not known on this machine"
msgid "This plugin's settings are not known here yet"
msgstr "這台電腦尚不知道此外掛程式的設定"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFace.qml:121
msgctxt "@info:status a recording light and its time, 'REC 00:12:04'"
msgid "REC %1"
msgstr "錄音中 %1"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFace.qml:123
msgctxt "@info:status a paused recording and its time"
msgid "PAUSED %1"
msgstr "已暫停 %1"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFace.qml:151
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:36
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:234
msgctxt "@action:button resume a paused recording"
msgid "Resume"
msgstr "繼續"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFace.qml:152
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:35
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:235
msgctxt "@action:button pause a recording"
msgid "Pause"
msgstr "暫停"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFace.qml:170
msgctxt "@action:button end this recording's file and start the next"
msgid "Split"
msgstr "分割"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFileName.qml:91
msgctxt "@label:textbox a recording's file name, tokens and all"
msgid "File name"
msgstr "檔案名稱"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFileName.qml:123
msgctxt "@action:button %1 is a file-name token, 'Session'"
msgid "Add %1 to the file name"
msgstr "將「%1」加入檔案名稱"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderFileName.qml:132
msgctxt "@info what the next recording's file will be called"
msgid "Next file: %1"
msgstr "下一個檔案：%1"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:17
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Writes the sound that reaches it to a file while the session runs, and passes"
" the sound on unchanged."
msgstr "工作階段執行時，將傳到此區塊的聲音寫入檔案，並將聲音原封不動地傳下去。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:22
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Put a Recorder anywhere in a lane. When you start the session, it starts a "
"file; when you stop the session, it finishes the file. The line at the top of"
" its settings says what it is doing, and for how long."
msgstr ""
"可將「錄音器」放在軌道中的任何位置。啟動工作階段時，它會開始一個檔案；停止工作階段時，它會完成該檔案。設定頂端的那一行會顯示它正在做什麼，以及已經持續多久。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:23
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The sound also goes on through the block as it is, with no delay, so the lane"
" can carry on to your speakers after it. Several Recorders can take the same "
"sound, each writing a file of its own."
msgstr "聲音也會原樣通過此區塊，沒有任何延遲，因此軌道可以在它之後繼續接到您的喇叭。多個「錄音器」可以接收同一個聲音，各自寫入自己的檔案。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:24
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Most settings are read when a file starts. A change made while it records "
"takes effect with the next file."
msgstr "大多數設定會在檔案開始時讀取。錄音期間所做的變更，會從下一個檔案開始生效。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:25
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Your recordings are listed in the Files tab of the sidebar. Listen to them "
"there, or open one to rename it or change its tags."
msgstr "您的錄音會列在側邊欄的「檔案」分頁中。可以在那裡聆聽，或開啟其中一個錄音來重新命名或變更標籤。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:30
msgctxt "@title a part of the Recorder's help page"
msgid "While it records"
msgstr "錄音期間"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:38
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Stops writing for a while; Resume carries on in the same file. The time it "
"was paused is left out, and the two parts follow on from each other."
msgstr "暫時停止寫入；按「繼續」會在同一個檔案中接著錄下去。暫停的時間不會包含在內，前後兩段會直接銜接。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:44
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:250
msgctxt "@action:button end this recording's file and start the next"
msgid "Split file"
msgstr "分割檔案"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:46
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Finishes the file it is writing and starts the next one at once, with nothing"
" lost in between. Use it to start a new song, a new speaker or a new chapter."
msgstr "完成正在寫入的檔案，並立即開始下一個，中間不會遺失任何聲音。可在換歌、換人說話或進入新章節時使用。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:51
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:269
msgctxt "@title:tab a Recorder's settings"
msgid "General"
msgstr "一般"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:56
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:298
msgctxt "@label a recording's file name"
msgid "File name"
msgstr "檔案名稱"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:58
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"What each file is called. Type your own words, and add pieces that are filled"
" in when the file starts, with the buttons under the box:"
msgstr "每個檔案的名稱。輸入您自己的文字，並用欄位下方的按鈕加入在檔案開始時才填入的項目："

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:61
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a piece of a file name"
msgid "Session: the session's name."
msgstr "工作階段：工作階段的名稱。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:62
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Recorder block, a piece of a file name; keep the date "
"as it is"
msgid "Date: the day, written year first, such as 2026-09-25."
msgstr "日期：當天日期，以年份開頭，例如 2026-09-25。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:63
msgctxt ""
"@info help page of the Recorder block, a piece of a file name; keep the time "
"as it is"
msgid ""
"Time: the time of day, such as 14-03-22. Hyphens rather than colons, which "
"many memory sticks refuse in a name."
msgstr "時間：當下的時刻，例如 14-03-22。使用連字號而不用冒號，因為許多隨身碟不接受名稱中有冒號。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:64
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a piece of a file name"
msgid "Counter: a number that counts up from 001, to keep names apart."
msgstr "計數器：從 001 開始遞增的數字，用來區分名稱。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:65
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a piece of a file name"
msgid ""
"Block: the name you gave this Recorder. Without one, it is a short code "
"instead."
msgstr "區塊：您為此「錄音器」取的名稱。若沒有取名，則改用一個簡短代碼。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:68
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The line under the box shows what the next file will be called. A new "
"Recorder names its files after the session, the date and the time."
msgstr "欄位下方的那一行會顯示下一個檔案的名稱。新的「錄音器」會以工作階段、日期和時間為檔案命名。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:69
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"A recording never replaces a file that is already there. When a name is "
"taken, a number in brackets is added after it, such as (2)."
msgstr "錄音絕不會取代已存在的檔案。名稱已被使用時，會在名稱後面加上括號中的數字，例如 (2)。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:75
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:320
msgctxt "@label the folder recordings go to"
msgid "Save to"
msgstr "儲存至"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:77
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:354
msgctxt "@action:button choose the folder recordings go to"
msgid "Choose Folder…"
msgstr "選擇資料夾…"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:78
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:367
msgctxt "@action:button open the folder recordings go to in the file manager"
msgid "Show in File Manager"
msgstr "在檔案管理員中顯示"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:81
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The folder the files go to. Left empty, it is a folder called Reverblabr in "
"your Music folder; the box shows which in grey."
msgstr "檔案存放的資料夾。留空時，會使用您「音樂」資料夾中名為 Reverblabr 的資料夾；欄位中會以灰色顯示是哪一個資料夾。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:82
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The folder button next to it lets you pick another folder, and the button "
"after it opens the folder in your file manager."
msgstr "旁邊的資料夾按鈕可讓您選擇其他資料夾，再後面的按鈕則會在檔案管理員中開啟該資料夾。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:88
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:380
msgctxt "@label:listbox how good a recording is, and how big"
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "品質"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:90
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The easy way to choose how the file is made. Each choice sets the format and "
"its details together, and the line under the list says what you get:"
msgstr "選擇檔案製作方式的簡便方法。每個選項會一併設定格式及其細節，清單下方的那一行會說明結果："

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:93
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a recording quality"
msgid "Voice: small files for speech, in one channel."
msgstr "人聲：適合語音的小檔案，單聲道。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:94
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a recording quality"
msgid "Standard MP3: good for most listening."
msgstr "標準 MP3：適合大多數的聆聽情境。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:95
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a recording quality"
msgid ""
"High-quality MP3: what a new Recorder uses. It sounds as good as MP3 gets for"
" most ears, and plays anywhere."
msgstr "高品質 MP3：新「錄音器」使用的選項。對大多數人的耳朵來說，已是 MP3 所能達到的最佳音質，而且到處都能播放。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:96
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a recording quality"
msgid "High-quality AAC: smaller than MP3 for the same sound."
msgstr "高品質 AAC：音質相同時，檔案比 MP3 小。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:97
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a recording quality"
msgid "Lossless: every bit of the sound kept, in about half the space."
msgstr "無損：完整保留聲音的每一個位元，只佔約一半的空間。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:98
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a recording quality"
msgid ""
"Uncompressed: every bit kept, in the biggest files, for editing afterwards."
msgstr "未壓縮：保留每一個位元，檔案最大，適合事後編輯。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:104
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:423
msgctxt "@title:group a recording's format and its settings"
msgid "Format options"
msgstr "格式選項"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:106
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The details Quality sets for you, to change one by one. Click the heading to "
"open them. Once you change one, Quality says Custom."
msgstr "「品質」為您設定的細節，可以逐項變更。按一下標題即可展開。只要變更其中一項，「品質」就會顯示「自訂」。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:112
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:430
msgctxt "@label:listbox a recording's file format"
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:114
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid "The kind of file. They come in three families:"
msgstr "檔案的種類。共分為三大類："

#. i18n: the format names are the same in every language.
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:118
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a family of formats"
msgid ""
"MP3, Opus, Ogg Vorbis and AAC make small files by leaving out details the ear"
" is unlikely to miss. This is called lossy compression."
msgstr "MP3、Opus、Ogg Vorbis 和 AAC 會省略耳朵不太可能察覺的細節，以產生小檔案。這稱為有損壓縮。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:119
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a family of formats"
msgid ""
"FLAC and ALAC keep every bit of the sound and still pack it smaller. This is "
"lossless compression."
msgstr "FLAC 和 ALAC 會保留聲音的每一個位元，同時仍能縮小檔案。這稱為無損壓縮。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:120
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a family of formats"
msgid ""
"WAV and AIFF keep the sound as it is, uncompressed, in the biggest files."
msgstr "WAV 和 AIFF 會以未壓縮的方式原樣保留聲音，檔案最大。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:123
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"AAC and ALAC are only offered when your system's audio libraries can write "
"them; a line under the options says so when they cannot. The other formats "
"always work."
msgstr "只有在系統的音訊函式庫能寫入 AAC 和 ALAC 時，才會提供這兩種格式；無法寫入時，選項下方會有一行說明。其他格式則一律可用。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:124
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"An AIFF file cannot grow past 4 GB, so an AIFF recording starts a new file by"
" itself at 2 GB or after 24 hours."
msgstr "AIFF 檔案無法超過 4 GB，因此 AIFF 錄音會在達到 2 GB 或 24 小時後自動開始新檔案。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:130
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:470
msgctxt "@label:listbox how many bits a second a recording keeps"
msgid "Bit rate"
msgstr "位元率"

#. i18n: kbps stands for kilobits per second.
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:137
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"For MP3, Opus, Ogg Vorbis and AAC: how much of the sound each second keeps, "
"from 32 to 320 kilobits a second (kbps). More sounds better and makes bigger "
"files. A new Recorder uses 256 kbps."
msgstr ""
"適用於 MP3、Opus、Ogg Vorbis 和 AAC：每秒保留多少聲音資料，範圍從每秒 32 到 320 "
"千位元（kbps）。數值越高，音質越好，檔案也越大。新的「錄音器」使用 256 kbps。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:138
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"VBR, a variable bit rate, spends more on busy passages and less on quiet "
"ones; it is the usual choice. CBR, a constant bit rate, spends the same every"
" second, which some old players need. AAC always uses a constant rate."
msgstr ""
"VBR（可變位元率）會在繁複的段落多用一些位元，在安靜的段落少用一些，是常見的選擇。CBR（固定位元率）每秒使用相同的位元數，某些舊型播放器需要這種方式。AAC"
" 一律使用固定位元率。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:144
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:539
msgctxt "@label:listbox how many bits each sample of a recording keeps"
msgid "Bit depth"
msgstr "位元深度"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:146
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"For WAV, AIFF, FLAC and ALAC: how finely each moment of the sound is "
"measured. 16-bit is CD quality. 24-bit, what a new Recorder uses, leaves room"
" for quiet recordings to be turned up later. 32-bit float can never clip in "
"the file, which helps if you edit it afterwards; FLAC and ALAC do not offer "
"it."
msgstr ""
"適用於 WAV、AIFF、FLAC 和 ALAC：聲音的每一瞬間測量得多精細。16 位元是 CD 品質。新的「錄音器」使用 24 "
"位元，讓小聲的錄音日後還有調大的空間。32 位元浮點在檔案中永遠不會削波，對事後編輯很有幫助；FLAC 和 ALAC 不提供此選項。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:152
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:583
msgctxt "@label:listbox a recording's sample rate"
msgid "Sample rate"
msgstr "取樣率"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:154
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"How many times a second the sound is measured. Follow session, the choice for"
" a new Recorder, uses whatever rate the session runs at. 44.1 kHz is the rate"
" of a CD and 48 kHz that of video; 88.2 kHz and 96 kHz are for studio work."
msgstr ""
"每秒測量聲音的次數。「跟隨工作階段」是新「錄音器」的預設選項，會使用工作階段目前執行的取樣率。44.1 kHz 是 CD 的取樣率，48 kHz "
"是視訊的取樣率；88.2 kHz 和 96 kHz 用於錄音室工作。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:155
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"A rate other than the session's is converted as the file is written. Opus "
"cannot be 44.1 kHz, so an Opus file that follows a 44.1 kHz session is made "
"at 48 kHz."
msgstr ""
"與工作階段不同的取樣率，會在寫入檔案時轉換。Opus 無法使用 44.1 kHz，因此跟隨 44.1 kHz 工作階段的 Opus 檔案會以 48 kHz"
" 製作。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:161
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:624
msgctxt "@label how many channels a recording has"
msgid "Channels"
msgstr "聲道"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:163
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:103
msgctxt "@item two channels in a recording"
msgid "Stereo"
msgstr "立體聲"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:164
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:102
msgctxt "@item one channel in a recording"
msgid "Mono"
msgstr "單聲道"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:167
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Stereo keeps the left and the right side apart. Mono mixes the two into one "
"channel, which is all a voice needs and makes the file smaller."
msgstr "立體聲會將左右兩側分開保留。單聲道則把兩側混合成一個聲道，對人聲來說已經足夠，檔案也較小。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:172
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:270
msgctxt "@title:tab a Recorder's settings"
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "標籤"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:181
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:690
msgctxt "@label a recording's tag"
msgid "Disc"
msgstr "光碟"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:182
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:691
msgctxt "@label a recording's tag, how many discs there are"
msgid "Of discs"
msgstr "光碟總數"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:186
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Tags are the details a music player shows about a file: its title, artist, "
"album, genre, year, track and disc numbers, and a comment. Whatever you fill "
"in here is written into each file when it is finished."
msgstr "標籤是音樂播放器顯示的檔案資訊：標題、演出者、專輯、類型、年份、曲目與光碟編號，以及註解。您在這裡填寫的內容，會在每個檔案完成時寫入其中。"

#. i18n: %session, %date, %year and %counter are typed as they are and must not
#. be translated.
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:188
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"The pieces of a file name work here too: type %session, %date, %year or "
"%counter. A Track of %counter numbers the files of a recording that was "
"split."
msgstr ""
"檔案名稱的組成項目在這裡也能使用：輸入 %session、%date、%year 或 %counter。將「曲目」設為 "
"%counter，就會為分割後錄音的各個檔案依序編號。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:193
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:271
msgctxt "@title:tab a Recorder's settings"
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "限制"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:195
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Rules for when a recording splits into files or stops by itself. Each is off "
"until you tick it."
msgstr "決定錄音何時自動分割成多個檔案或自動停止的規則。每項規則在您勾選之前都不會作用。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:201
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:753
msgctxt "@option:check followed by a number and a unit"
msgid "Start a new file every"
msgstr "開始新檔案的間隔"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:202
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:801
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:866
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Unit"
msgstr "單位"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:204
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Splits a long recording into files of the same length, in minutes or hours, "
"or of the same size, in megabytes (MB). Nothing is lost between two files. "
"When you tick it, it starts at 30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"將長時間的錄音分割成長度相同（以分鐘或小時計）或大小相同（以百萬位元組 MB 計）的檔案。兩個檔案之間不會遺失任何聲音。勾選時，起始值為 30 分鐘。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:210
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:819
msgctxt "@option:check followed by a number and a unit"
msgid "End the recording after"
msgstr "錄音時長上限"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:212
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Stops the recording by itself after so many minutes or hours of it, counted "
"across all its files and not while it is paused. When you tick it, it starts "
"at 1 hour. The session goes on running; the line at the top then says the "
"recording stopped at its time limit."
msgstr ""
"錄音達到指定的分鐘數或小時數後自動停止，時間會跨所有檔案累計，暫停期間不計。勾選時，起始值為 1 "
"小時。工作階段會繼續執行；頂端的那一行會顯示錄音已因達到時間上限而停止。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:218
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:889
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Act on silence"
msgstr "遇靜音時處理"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:220
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:910
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "What silence does"
msgstr "靜音時的動作"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:221
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:940
msgctxt "@label:spinbox"
msgid "Seconds of silence"
msgstr "靜音秒數"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:224
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Tick the box at the start of the row to do something once the sound has been "
"silent for a while. Choose what in the list, and how many seconds of silence "
"it waits for in the box after it: 2 seconds for a new Recorder."
msgstr ""
"勾選該列開頭的方塊，即可在聲音靜默一段時間後執行某個動作。在清單中選擇要做什麼，並在其後的欄位中設定要等待幾秒的靜音：新的「錄音器」為 2 秒。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:227
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a choice of what silence does"
msgid ""
"Remove silence: the silence after those seconds is left out of the file, "
"until sound comes back."
msgstr "移除靜音：超過這幾秒之後的靜音不會寫入檔案，直到聲音再次出現。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:228
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a choice of what silence does"
msgid ""
"Split on silence: the file ends after those seconds, and the next one starts "
"when sound comes back. Good for recording songs from a playlist into a file "
"each."
msgstr "遇靜音分割：經過這幾秒後結束檔案，聲音再次出現時開始下一個檔案。適合將播放清單中的歌曲各錄成一個檔案。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:229
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block, a choice of what silence does"
msgid "Stop on silence: the recording ends after those seconds."
msgstr "遇靜音停止：經過這幾秒後結束錄音。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:235
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:962
msgctxt "@label:slider the level below which a recording counts as silent"
msgid "Silence below"
msgstr "低於此值視為靜音"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:236
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:972
msgctxt "@label:slider"
msgid "Silence threshold"
msgstr "靜音臨界值"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:238
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"How quiet the sound must be, on every channel, to count as silence: from −96 "
"dB, near-total silence, to −20 dB, which takes in a fair amount of background"
" noise. A new Recorder uses −60 dB."
msgstr ""
"聲音在每個聲道上要多小聲才算靜音：從 −96 dB（幾乎完全無聲）到 −20 dB（包含相當多的背景雜訊）。新的「錄音器」使用 −60 dB。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:239
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"If the hiss of a quiet room keeps your recording from ever counting as "
"silent, move the slider to the right."
msgstr "如果安靜房間裡的嘶聲讓錄音始終無法被判定為靜音，請將滑桿往右移。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:246
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid "Recording a call, a lesson or a podcast from the programs that play it."
msgstr "錄下程式中正在播放的通話、課程或 Podcast。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:247
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Recording a microphone, with the blocks that clean it up placed before the "
"Recorder."
msgstr "錄製麥克風的聲音，並在「錄音器」之前放置清理聲音的區塊。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:248
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Keeping a long broadcast as a file every hour, or recording music into a file"
" a song."
msgstr "將長時間的廣播每小時存成一個檔案，或將音樂錄成一首歌一個檔案。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:255
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Put a Peak/RMS meter just before the Recorder and check the level before you "
"start."
msgstr "在「錄音器」前方放一個「峰值/RMS」儀表，開始前先檢查準位。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:256
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"Choose Voice for speech you only need to listen to again, and Lossless or "
"Uncompressed for anything you will edit."
msgstr "只需重聽的語音請選擇「人聲」，要編輯的內容則選擇「無損」或「未壓縮」。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:257
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid ""
"If Reverblabr or the computer stops suddenly, the file still plays up to the "
"last few seconds, and Reverblabr restores the rest the next time it starts."
msgstr "如果 Reverblabr 或電腦突然停止，檔案仍可播放到最後幾秒之前的內容，而 Reverblabr 會在下次啟動時復原其餘部分。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderHelp.qml:258
msgctxt "@info help page of the Recorder block"
msgid "Before you record anyone but yourself, ask them first."
msgstr "錄下自己以外的任何人之前，請先徵得對方同意。"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:336
msgctxt "@label:textbox"
msgid "Save to"
msgstr "儲存至"

#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:482
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderPanel.qml:490
#: blocks/recorder/ui/RecorderWords.qml:110
